    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="nav-search">
    <span class="mag">🔎</span>
    <input type="text" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Search stocks"
      placeholder="Search any stock, ETF, commodity or crypto…" data-ph-zh="搜索任意股票、ETF、商品或加密货币…">
    <div class="nav-sugg"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="nav-ctrls">
    <a class="ai-brief-link" href="aibrief.html">🧠 {{ t('AI Daily Brief', 'AI每日简报') }}</a>
    <button class="theme-switch" aria-label="Toggle dark / light mode">
      <span class="ic sun">☀️</span><span class="ic moon">🌙</span><span class="knob"></span>
    </button>
    <div class="lang-toggle" role="group" aria-label="Language">
      <span class="pill"></span>
      <span class="opt en-opt" data-l="en">EN</span>
      <span class="opt zh-opt" data-l="zh">中文</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>
<div class="grid">

  {% if mode == 'stocks' %}
  <!-- ===================== US STOCK DASHBOARD HEADER ===================== -->
  <div class="panel span12" id="stocks-header">
    <div class="topline">
      <h1>🇺🇸 {{ t('US Stock Dashboard', '美国个股看板') }}</h1>
      <span class="badge quad-{{ latest.quad }}">{{ td(latest.quad_name) }}</span>
      {% if pb and pb.dial %}<span class="badge" style="background:var(--panel2);color:var(--text)">{{ td(pb.dial.posture) }}</span>{% endif %}
    </div>
    <p class="muted" style="margin:6px 0 0">{{ t('Where to look for stocks — standouts, sector rotation, factor tilts and real fund flows, filtered by the current macro regime.', '在哪里找股票 — 精选个股、板块轮动、因子倾斜与基金真实资金流，按当前宏观周期过滤。') }}
      <a href="macro.html" style="color:var(--link);font-weight:600">← {{ t('Macro regime dashboard', '宏观周期看板') }}</a></p>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  {% if mode != 'stocks' %}
  <!-- ======================= HEADER ======================= -->
  <div class="panel span12" id="regime-radar">
    <div class="topline">
      <h1>{{ t('Macro Regime Dashboard', '宏观周期仪表盘') }}</h1>
      <span class="badge quad-{{ latest.quad }}">{{ td(latest.quad_name) }}</span>
      <span class="help">?<span class="tip tip-map">
        <span class="l-en">
        <b>The four market regimes</b> — combinations of growth and inflation direction.
        (Sometimes written Q1–Q4, but these are <b>quadrants, NOT calendar quarters</b>.)
        <span class="qgrid">
          <span class="qax"></span>
          <span class="qax">inflation falling ↓</span>
          <span class="qax">inflation rising ↑</span>
          <span class="qax">growth<br>rising ↑</span>
          <span class="qcell{{ ' qcur' if latest.quad == 'Q1' }}" style="background:var(--q1)">GOLDILOCKS<br><small>best for tech & quality</small></span>
          <span class="qcell{{ ' qcur' if latest.quad == 'Q2' }}" style="background:var(--q2);color:#1a1a1a">REFLATION<br><small>cyclicals, energy, banks</small></span>
          <span class="qax">growth<br>falling ↓</span>
          <span class="qcell{{ ' qcur' if latest.quad == 'Q4' }}" style="background:var(--q4)">GROWTH SCARE<br><small>defensives & bonds</small></span>
          <span class="qcell{{ ' qcur' if latest.quad == 'Q3' }}" style="background:var(--q3)">STAGFLATION<br><small>the dangerous one</small></span>
        </span>
        The label changes only after 7 straight days of evidence (or one extreme shock day),
        so it doesn't flip-flop. Today's regime is outlined in white.
        </span>
        <span class="l-zh">
        <b>四种市场周期</b> — 增长方向与通胀方向的组合。
        （有时写作 Q1–Q4，但这是<b>象限，而非日历季度</b>。）
        <span class="qgrid">
          <span class="qax"></span>
          <span class="qax">通胀下行 ↓</span>
          <span class="qax">通胀上行 ↑</span>
          <span class="qax">增长<br>上行 ↑</span>
          <span class="qcell{{ ' qcur' if latest.quad == 'Q1' }}" style="background:var(--q1)">理想增长<br><small>最利好科技与质量</small></span>
          <span class="qcell{{ ' qcur' if latest.quad == 'Q2' }}" style="background:var(--q2);color:#1a1a1a">再通胀<br><small>周期股、能源、银行</small></span>
          <span class="qax">增长<br>下行 ↓</span>
          <span class="qcell{{ ' qcur' if latest.quad == 'Q4' }}" style="background:var(--q4)">增长恐慌<br><small>防御板块与债券</small></span>
          <span class="qcell{{ ' qcur' if latest.quad == 'Q3' }}" style="background:var(--q3)">滞胀<br><small>最危险的那一种</small></span>
        </span>
        标签只有在连续 7 天证据一致（或单日极端冲击）后才会改变，
        因此不会反复横跳。今日周期以白色边框标出。
        </span>
      </span></span>
      <span class="badge state-{{ latest.transition_state }}">{{ td(latest.transition_state) }}</span>
      <span class="help">?<span class="tip">
        <span class="l-en">
        <b>The transition radar</b> — is the current regime ending? It escalates as warning
        signals stack up:
        <span class="lad lad-tint" style="--c:var(--muted)">⚪ <b>STABLE</b> — no warnings. Trust the regime label.</span>
        <span class="lad lad-tint" style="--c:var(--warn)">🟠 <b>WEAKENING</b> — 2+ warnings. Stop adding regime-dependent bets.</span>
        <span class="lad lad-tint" style="--c:var(--orange)">🔶 <b>TRANSITIONING</b> — 3+ warnings. The regime is likely ending before the label flips — reduce risk now.</span>
        <span class="lad lad-tint" style="--c:var(--down)">🚨 <b>NEW REGIME</b> — the label changed within the last week.</span>
        The warnings: thinning participation, nervous credit, risk-ratios turning, inflation
        trades turning, signal disagreement, fragile options positioning.
        </span>
        <span class="l-zh">
        <b>转换雷达</b> — 当前周期是否正在结束？随着预警信号累积而升级：
        <span class="lad lad-tint" style="--c:var(--muted)">⚪ <b>稳定</b> — 无预警。信任周期标签。</span>
        <span class="lad lad-tint" style="--c:var(--warn)">🟠 <b>走弱</b> — 2 个以上预警。停止加注依赖周期的押注。</span>
        <span class="lad lad-tint" style="--c:var(--orange)">🔶 <b>转换中</b> — 3 个以上预警。周期很可能在标签翻转之前就已结束 — 立即降低风险。</span>
        <span class="lad lad-tint" style="--c:var(--down)">🚨 <b>新周期</b> — 标签在过去一周内已改变。</span>
        预警包括：参与度变薄、信用市场紧张、风险比率反转、通胀交易反转、信号分歧、期权仓位脆弱。
        </span>
      </span></span>
      <span class="kv">{{ t('signal agreement', '信号一致度') }} <b>{{ (latest.confidence * 100) | round | int }}%</b></span>
      <span class="help">?<span class="tip">
        <span class="l-en">
        <b>Signal agreement</b> — how many of the ~14 underlying indicators point the
        same way. Today: <b>{{ (latest.confidence * 100) | round | int }}%</b>.
        <span class="scale">
          <span style="background:var(--down)">MIXED</span>
          <span style="background:var(--warn)">OK</span>
          <span style="background:var(--up)">SOLID</span>
        </span>
        <span class="sl"><span>0%</span><span>30%</span><span>45%</span><span>100%</span></span>
        <b>Mixed</b>: the indicators disagree — expect chop, size down, trust the radar
        more than the label. <b>OK</b>: usable with caution. <b>Solid</b>: the regime
        call is well-supported.
        </span>
        <span class="l-zh">
        <b>信号一致度</b> — 约 14 个底层指标中有多少指向同一方向。
        今日：<b>{{ (latest.confidence * 100) | round | int }}%</b>。
        <span class="scale">
          <span style="background:var(--down)">分歧</span>
          <span style="background:var(--warn)">尚可</span>
          <span style="background:var(--up)">扎实</span>
        </span>
        <span class="sl"><span>0%</span><span>30%</span><span>45%</span><span>100%</span></span>
        <b>分歧</b>：指标互相矛盾 — 预期震荡，缩小仓位，相信雷达多于标签。
        <b>尚可</b>：可用，但需谨慎。<b>扎实</b>：周期判断有充分支撑。
        </span>
      </span></span>
      <span class="kv">{{ t('Fed liquidity', '美联储流动性') }} <b>{{ td(latest.liquidity_overlay) }}</b></span>
      <span class="help">?<span class="tip">
        <span class="l-en">
        <b>Fed liquidity</b> — net money flowing into or out of the financial system
        (Fed balance sheet − reverse-repo parking − the government's checking account),
        measured as a 4-week trend.
        <table>
          <tr><th></th><th>meaning</th><th>history says</th></tr>
          <tr><td>🟢 <b>expanding</b></td><td>money tide rising</td><td>the most reliable tailwind we tested: stocks up ~73% of months</td></tr>
          <tr><td>⚪ <b>neutral</b></td><td>roughly flat</td><td>no signal</td></tr>
          <tr><td>🔴 <b>contracting</b></td><td>money draining</td><td>persistent headwind — be choosier</td></tr>
        </table>
        </span>
        <span class="l-zh">
        <b>美联储流动性</b> — 净流入或流出金融系统的资金
        （美联储资产负债表 − 逆回购停泊 − 政府活期账户），以 4 周趋势衡量。
        <table>
          <tr><th></th><th>含义</th><th>历史显示</th></tr>
          <tr><td>🟢 <b>扩张</b></td><td>资金潮上涨</td><td>我们测试过最可靠的顺风：股市约 73% 的月份上涨</td></tr>
          <tr><td>⚪ <b>中性</b></td><td>大致持平</td><td>无信号</td></tr>
          <tr><td>🔴 <b>收缩</b></td><td>资金流失</td><td>持续逆风 — 需更挑剔</td></tr>
        </table>
        </span>
      </span></span>
      <span class="kv">{{ t('cycle', '商业周期') }} <b>{{ td(latest.cycle_tag) }}</b></span>
      <span class="help">?<span class="tip">
        <span class="l-en">
        <b>Business-cycle position</b> — the multi-year backdrop (from the yield curve,
        credit spreads and market breadth). Slower-moving than the regime.
        <table>
          <tr><td>🌱 <b>early</b></td><td>recovering after stress — historically the best risk/reward</td></tr>
          <tr><td>☀️ <b>mid</b></td><td>expansion cruising — normal conditions</td></tr>
          <tr><td>🌇 <b>late</b></td><td>curve inverted/flattening, breadth thinning — enjoy it, but keep one eye on the exit</td></tr>
        </table>
        Context only — it sizes your patience, not your trades.
        </span>
        <span class="l-zh">
        <b>商业周期位置</b> — 多年期的大背景（来自收益率曲线、信用利差与市场广度）。
        比周期标签变化更慢。
        <table>
          <tr><td>🌱 <b>早期</b></td><td>压力后复苏 — 历史上风险回报最佳</td></tr>
          <tr><td>☀️ <b>中期</b></td><td>扩张平稳推进 — 正常环境</td></tr>
          <tr><td>🌇 <b>晚期</b></td><td>曲线倒挂／走平，广度变薄 — 享受它，但留意出口</td></tr>
        </table>
        仅作背景参考 — 它决定你的耐心，而非你的交易。
        </span>
      </span></span>
    </div>
    <details class="howto">
      <summary>{{ t('New here? How to read this page in 60 seconds', '初次访问？60 秒读懂本页') }}</summary>
      <div>
        <span class="l-en">
        <b>1.</b> The colored badge is the market regime — the "weather" (not a calendar quarter!). The second badge is the transition radar — whether that weather is about to change.<br>
        <b>2.</b> <b>Where we are</b> shows how far along this regime likely is. <b>What's likely next</b> gives the historical odds of each path and what to do about it. <b>How to trade it</b> turns today's conditions into a posture and concrete names.<br>
        <b>3.</b> Everything below that is supporting evidence. Hover any <span class="help">?</span> for a plain-English explanation. <span class="pos">Green = risk-friendly</span>, <span class="neg">red = risk-hostile</span>.<br>
        <b>4.</b> This is a context machine with measured odds, not a crystal ball.
        </span>
        <span class="l-zh">
        <b>1.</b> 彩色徽章是市场周期 — 即"天气"（不是日历季度！）。第二个徽章是转换雷达 — 这种天气是否即将改变。<br>
        <b>2.</b> <b>我们身处何处</b>显示当前周期大致走到哪一步。<b>接下来可能发生什么</b>给出每条路径的历史概率及应对方式。<b>如何交易</b>把今日条件转化为持仓姿态与具体标的。<br>
        <b>3.</b> 其下的所有内容都是佐证。将鼠标悬停在任意 <span class="help">?</span> 上可获得通俗解释。<span class="pos">绿色 = 风险友好</span>，<span class="neg">红色 = 风险敌对</span>。<br>
        <b>4.</b> 这是一台带有量化概率的背景分析机器，而非水晶球。
        </span>
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>

  <!-- ===================== TURNING-POINT FRAGILITY — conviction guardrail (display-only) ===================== -->
  {% if latest.turning_point and latest.turning_point.present %}
  {% set TP = latest.turning_point %}
  {% set tpc = 'var(--down)' if TP.state=='fragile-structural' else ('var(--muted)' if TP.state=='cooling' else 'var(--orange)') %}
  {% set _stx = {'RORO extreme':'RORO 极值','capitulation':'恐慌投降','regime transitioning':'周期转换中','rate path priced':'利率路径已定价'} %}
  <div class="panel span12" id="turning-point" style="border-left:3px solid {{ tpc }}">
    <h2>⚠️ {{ t(TP.headline_en, TP.headline_zh) }}
      {{ help("A conviction guardrail, NOT a signal. It fires only when the tape is one-factor (six markets on one macro bet), a macro-shock driver dominates, and positioning is stretched — the configuration that whipsaws on a fast catalyst. It lowers stated conviction; it never tells you to fade. It is read across existing leaves and is never scored, because it cannot distinguish a forced, reversible move from an early, real regime change.", "这是确信度护栏，并非信号。仅当行情呈单因子（六个市场押注同一宏观主题）、某一宏观冲击驱动占主导、且仓位被拉伸时才触发——这正是快速催化剂下容易剧烈反复的格局。它只降低确信度，绝不提示做空。它跨既有读数综合得出，从不计入评分，因为它无法区分被迫的可逆移动与早期的真实周期变化。") }}
    </h2>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="span12" style="background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:3px solid {{ tpc }};border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px">
        <div class="muted sm" style="margin-bottom:6px">{{ t('Display-only — these reads are coincident, not predictive. The dashboard is NOT telling you a direction here.', '仅供显示 — 此处读数为巧合同步，并非预测。仪表盘在此并不告诉你方向。') }}</div>
        <div>{{ t(TP.message_en, TP.message_zh) }}</div>
        <div style="margin-top:8px;font-weight:700;color:{{ tpc }}">→ {{ t(TP.size_note_en, TP.size_note_zh) }}</div>
        {% if TP.defer_to == 'dislocation' %}
        <div class="sm" style="margin-top:7px;color:var(--down)">↘ {{ t('See the', '参见') }} <a href="#dislocation" style="color:var(--down);text-decoration:underline">{{ t('Dislocation gate', '错位一道闸') }}</a> {{ t('— this is its falling-knife regime, not a fade.', '— 此为接飞刀情形，而非做空机会。') }}</div>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="sm muted" style="margin-top:9px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:7px">
          <b>{{ t('Why it fired', '触发原因') }}:</b>
          {% if TP.drivers.one_factor %}{{ t('one-factor tape', '单因子行情') }}{% if TP.drivers.absorption_pctile is not none %} ({{ t('absorption', '吸收率') }} {{ (TP.drivers.absorption_pctile*100)|round|int }}{{ t('th pct', ' 百分位') }}){% endif %} · {% endif %}
          {% if TP.drivers.primary_label %}{{ t('driver', '驱动') }}: {{ t(TP.drivers.primary_label, TP.drivers.primary_label_zh or TP.drivers.primary_label) }} · {% endif %}
          {% if TP.drivers.stretched %}{{ t('stretched', '拉伸') }}: {% for s in TP.drivers.stretched %}{{ t(s, _stx.get(s, s)) }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ===================== SIGNAL STACK — consolidated cross-subsystem read ===================== -->
  {% if signal_stack %}
  <div class="panel span12" id="signal-stack">
    <h2>{{ t('Signal stack — where the evidence agrees & disagrees', '信号堆栈 — 证据在何处一致、在何处分歧') }}
      {{ help("Institutions don't ask 'is it bullish?' — they ask 'which parts of the evidence disagree?'. This collapses the dashboard's subsystem reads into one stack: each leg's lean, the regime-core agreement, and the single biggest contradiction. It re-presents signals detailed below — it invents nothing and is never scored. SCORED legs drive the regime / allocation; CONTEXT legs are positioning colour only.", "机构不会问'是不是看多？'，而是问'证据的哪些部分相互矛盾？'。这把仪表盘各子系统读数汇聚为一个堆栈：每条腿的倾向、周期核心一致度，以及最大的那条矛盾。它只是对下方详述信号的再呈现 — 不创造新信号，也从不计入评分。已评分腿驱动周期／仓位；背景腿仅为仓位色彩。") }}
    </h2>
    <div class="sstack-grid">
      <div class="sstack-legs">
        {% for leg in signal_stack.legs %}
        <div class="sstack-leg">
          <span class="sstack-dot tone-{{ leg.tone }}"></span>
          <span class="sstack-name">{{ t(leg.label_en, leg.label_zh) }}{% if leg.tier == 'context' %}<span class="sstack-tier">{{ t('context', '背景') }}</span>{% endif %}</span>
          <span class="sstack-state tone-{{ leg.tone }}">{{ t(leg.state_en, leg.state_zh) }}</span>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <div class="sstack-verdict">
        <div class="sstack-final tone-{{ signal_stack.anchor_tone }}">{{ t('Final', '结论') }}: <b>{{ t(signal_stack.final_en, signal_stack.final_zh) }}</b></div>
        {% if signal_stack.agreement_pct is not none %}
        <div class="sstack-agree">{{ t('Regime agreement', '周期一致度') }} <b>{{ signal_stack.agreement_pct }}%</b>{% if signal_stack.quality_en %} — {{ t(signal_stack.quality_en, signal_stack.quality_zh) }}{% endif %}</div>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="sstack-tally"><b class="tone-up">{{ signal_stack.n_bull }}</b> {{ t('constructive', '建设性') }} · <b>{{ signal_stack.n_flat }}</b> {{ t('neutral', '中性') }} · <b class="tone-down">{{ signal_stack.n_bear }}</b> {{ t('cautionary', '谨慎') }} {{ t('of', '／共') }} {{ signal_stack.n }}</div>
        {% if signal_stack.contradiction_en %}
        <div class="sstack-contra">⚠ {{ t('Main contradiction', '主要矛盾') }}: {{ t(signal_stack.contradiction_en, signal_stack.contradiction_zh) }}</div>
        {% else %}
        <div class="sstack-contra ok">✓ {{ t('Broad agreement — no leg is fighting the regime', '广泛一致 — 没有腿与周期相左') }}</div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="muted sm" style="margin:10px 0 0">{{ t('Display-only consolidation of the signals detailed below — it changes no score. The agreement % is the validated regime-core read; the legs are context.', '仅为下方详述信号的展示性汇总 — 不改变任何评分。一致度为经验证的周期核心读数；各腿为背景。') }}</p>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ===================== BONDS & FX CROSS-CHECK — do the fast markets confirm equities? ===================== -->
  {% if latest.cross_asset_confirm and latest.cross_asset_confirm.verdict not in [none, 'unknown'] %}
  {% set cac = latest.cross_asset_confirm %}
  {% set _cvtone = 'up' if cac.verdict == 'confirm' else ('down' if cac.verdict == 'diverge' else 'flat') %}
  <div class="panel span12" id="cross-asset-confirm">
    <h2>{{ t('Bonds & FX cross-check — do the fast markets confirm equities?', '债券与外汇交叉验证 — 快端市场是否确认股票？') }}
      {{ help("Bonds (credit, curve, rates-vol, sovereign) and FX (the dollar, EM carry) sit at the fast end of the macro complex. This compares their INDEPENDENT reads — the bond credit×curve cycle clock, credit / curve / rates-vol bands, the dollar-smile regime, EM-FX conviction — against the equity cycle & risk read. Honestly graded: only credit/EBP and the curve have a (noisy) leading horizon; rates-vol-vs-VIX, the dollar/EM risk-off read and FX carry are COINCIDENT confirmation, and the stock-bond correlation is a slow regime descriptor. DISPLAY-ONLY — never scored; a divergence is an attention flag, not a forecast.", "债券（信用、曲线、利率波动、主权）与外汇（美元、新兴市场套息）处于宏观体系的快端。本面板将它们的独立读数 — 债券信用×曲线时钟、信用／曲线／利率波动区间、美元微笑周期、新兴市场外汇信念 — 与股票周期与风险读数作对比。诚实分级：仅信用/EBP与曲线具（嘈杂的）领先性；利率波动对VIX、美元/新兴市场避险读数与外汇套息为同步确认，股债相关性为缓慢的周期描述。仅供展示 — 从不评分；背离是关注信号，而非预测。") }}
      <span class="badge tone-{{ _cvtone }}" style="float:right">{{ t(cac.verdict, cac.verdict_zh) }}{% if cac.agree_pct is not none %} · {{ cac.agree_pct }}%{% endif %}{% if cac.confidence %} · {{ t('conf', '信心') }} {{ t(cac.confidence_en or cac.confidence, cac.confidence_zh or cac.confidence) }}{% endif %}</span>
    </h2>
    <div style="background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:3px solid var({{ '--up' if _cvtone=='up' else ('--down' if _cvtone=='down' else '--muted') }});border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;font-weight:600">
      {{ t(cac.headline_en, cac.headline_zh) }}
    </div>
    {% if cac.cycle %}
    <div class="muted sm" style="margin-top:8px">
      {{ t('Cycle clock', '周期时钟') }}: {{ t('equities', '股票') }} <b>{{ td(cac.cycle.equity) if cac.cycle.equity else '—' }}</b>
      · {{ t('bonds', '债券') }} <b>{{ t(cac.cycle.bonds_en or cac.cycle.bonds or '—', cac.cycle.bonds_zh or cac.cycle.bonds or '—') }}</b>
      {% if cac.cycle.fx_regime %} · {{ t('dollar-smile', '美元微笑') }} <b>{{ t(cac.cycle.fx_regime, cac.cycle.fx_regime_zh or cac.cycle.fx_regime) }}</b>{% endif %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;margin-top:10px">
      {% for leg in cac.legs %}
      <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start">
        <span class="sstack-dot tone-{{ leg.tone }}" style="margin-top:5px;flex:0 0 auto"></span>
        <div><b>{{ t(leg.label_en, leg.label_zh) }}</b> — <span class="muted">{{ t(leg.detail_en, leg.detail_zh) }}</span></div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% if cac.caution_flags %}
    <div style="margin-top:10px">
      <div class="sm" style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px">{{ t('Cross-asset caution flags', '跨资产关注信号') }}</div>
      {% for f in cac.caution_flags %}
      <div class="sm" style="padding:4px 8px;margin:3px 0;border-left:3px solid var({{ '--down' if f.severity=='high' else ('--warn' if f.severity=='medium' else '--muted') }});background:var(--panel2);border-radius:4px">
        {{ t(f.en, f.zh) }}
        <span class="badge sm" style="margin-left:4px">{{ f.owner|upper }} · {{ t('leading', '领先') if f.lead=='leading' else t('coincident', '同步') }}{% if f.equity_blind %} · {{ t('equities not yet showing it', '股票尚未显示') }}{% endif %}</span>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    <p class="muted sm" style="margin:10px 0 0">{{ t(cac.note_en, cac.note_zh) }}</p>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ===================== MAJOR US INDEXES — HEALTH & RISK ===================== -->
  <div class="panel span12" id="index-health">
    <h2>{{ t('Major US indexes — health & drawdown risk', '美国主要指数 — 健康度与回撤风险') }}
      {{ help("How the market itself is doing, before the economy. Price, % below the 52-week high (drawdown), trend vs the 50/200-day averages, and RSI(14) for the four major US indexes — alongside the validated macro de-risk read that drives the allocation strategy.", "在看经济之前，先看市场本身。四大美国指数的价格、距52周高点的回撤、相对50/200日均线的趋势、RSI(14) — 以及驱动仓位策略的经验证宏观降险读数。") }}
    </h2>
    <div class="idx-grid">
      {% for ix in index_health %}
      <div class="idx-tile">
        <div class="idx-top"><b>{{ t(ix.label, ix.label_zh) }}</b> <span class="idx-px">{{ '%.2f'|format(ix.price) }}</span></div>
        <div class="idx-row">
          <span class="{{ 'pos' if ix.dd >= -1 else ('warn' if ix.dd >= -10 else 'neg') }}">{{ '%+.1f'|format(ix.dd) }}% {{ t('off high', '距高点') }}</span>
          <span>RSI {{ ix.rsi if ix.rsi is not none else '—' }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="idx-trend">
          <span class="{{ 'pos' if ix.above200 else 'neg' }}">{{ '✓' if ix.above200 else '✕' }} 200d</span>
          <span class="{{ 'pos' if ix.above50 else 'neg' }}">{{ '✓' if ix.above50 else '✕' }} 50d</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="idx-risk">
      {% set dr = latest.conditions.drawdown_risk %}
      {% set rc = latest.conditions.recession %}
      <div class="idx-gauge">
        <div class="idx-gk">{{ t('Drawdown risk', '回撤风险') }}</div>
        <div class="idx-gv">{{ dr.score|round|int if dr and dr.score is not none else '—' }}<small>/100</small></div>
        <div class="muted" style="font-size:11px">{% if dr and dr.dd10_prob_pct is not none %}{{ t('P(≥10% / 63d)', '概率(≥10%/63日)') }} {{ dr.dd10_prob_pct }}%{% endif %}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="idx-gauge">
        <div class="idx-gk">{{ t('Recession risk', '衰退风险') }}</div>
        <div class="idx-gv">{{ rc.score|round|int if rc and rc.score is not none else '—' }}<small>/100</small></div>
        <div class="muted" style="font-size:11px">{% if rc and rc.label %}{{ td(rc.label) }}{% endif %}</div>
      </div>
      {% if alloc_card and alloc_card.present %}
      <a class="idx-alloc" href="spvector.html">
        <div class="idx-gk">{{ t('S&P Vector allocation', '标普向量仓位') }} →</div>
        <div class="idx-gv" style="color:{{ '#1FA971' if alloc_card.band == 'low' else ('var(--warn)' if alloc_card.band in ['elevated','high'] else 'var(--down)') }}">{{ alloc_card.equity_w }}%<small> {{ t('equity', '股票') }}</small></div>
        <div class="muted" style="font-size:11px">{{ t('de-risk score', '降险分') }} {{ alloc_card.score }} · Sharpe {{ alloc_card.sharpe }} · MaxDD {{ alloc_card.maxdd }}%</div>
      </a>
      {% else %}
      <a class="idx-alloc" href="spvector.html">
        <div class="idx-gk">◎ {{ t('Allocation strategy', '仓位策略') }} →</div>
        <div class="muted" style="font-size:12px;margin-top:4px">{{ t('S&P 500 ↔ T-bills — a validated drawdown / Sharpe engine.', '标普500 ↔ 短债 — 经验证的回撤 / 夏普引擎。') }}</div>
      </a>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    {% if risk_model and risk_model.legs %}
    <h3 style="margin-top:16px">{{ t('Index risk model — what is driving de-risk', '指数风险模型 — 降险信号由什么驱动') }}
      {{ help("The S&P Vector de-risk score (0-100) and the legs that build it: macro-stress drawdown gauge, recession risk, financial conditions, credit-spread widening, and net-liquidity. Each leg's points sum to the score, so the bar shows exactly what is risk-on or risk-off now. The full allocation strategy + backtest lives on the S&P Vector page.", "标普向量降险评分（0-100）及其构成分项：宏观压力回撤计、衰退风险、金融条件、信用利差走阔、净流动性。各分项贡献分相加即为总分，进度条直观显示当前什么在加／降风险。完整仓位策略与回测见标普向量页。") }}
    </h3>
    <div class="rm-bar">{% for lg in risk_model.legs %}{% if lg.active and lg.points %}<div style="width:{{ lg.points }}%;background:{{ lg.color }}" title="{{ lg.label }}: {{ lg.points }}"></div>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>
    <div class="muted" style="font-size:11px">{{ t('Filled = de-risk score out of 100.', '填充 = 满分100的降险评分。') }} <a href="spvector.html" style="font-weight:600">{{ t('Full allocation strategy →', '完整仓位策略 →') }}</a></div>
    <table class="rm-tbl">
      <tr><th class="l">{{ t('Risk leg', '风险分项') }}</th><th>{{ t('Intensity', '强度') }}</th><th>{{ t('Weight', '权重') }}</th><th>{{ t('Pub lag', '发布滞后') }}</th><th>{{ t('Points', '贡献') }}</th></tr>
      {% for lg in risk_model.legs %}
      <tr><td class="l"><span class="rm-dot" style="background:{{ lg.color }}"></span>{{ t(lg.label, lg.label_zh) }}</td>
        <td>{{ (lg.value|round|int ~ '/100') if lg.value is not none else '—' }}</td>
        <td>{{ '%.1f'|format(lg.weight) }}</td>
        <td>{{ lg.lag }}d</td>
        <td><b>{{ ('%.1f'|format(lg.points)) if lg.points is not none else '—' }}</b></td></tr>
      {% endfor %}
      <tr><td class="l"><b>{{ t('De-risk score', '降险评分') }}</b></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td><b>{{ risk_model.score }}</b></td></tr>
    </table>
    {% endif %}
    {% if chart_risk_model %}
    <h3 style="margin-top:16px">{{ t('Drawdown & recession risk — modeled (NBER recessions shaded)', '回撤与衰退风险 — 模型（阴影为NBER衰退期）') }}</h3>
    <div>{{ chart_risk_model | safe }}</div>
    {% endif %}
    {% if chart_curve or chart_vix_term %}
    <div class="grid" style="margin-top:14px">
      {% if chart_curve %}
      <div class="span6">
        <h3>{{ t('Yield curve — recession lead', '收益率曲线 — 衰退先行指标') }}
          {{ help("The 2-year/10-year slope, raw vs term-premium-adjusted. Below zero (inversion) is the classic recession lead. The TP-adjusted line strips the term premium so a low-term-premium flattening (e.g. 2022-24) isn't misread as a recession signal. NBER recessions shaded.", "2年／10年期利差，原始值对比剥离期限溢价后。低于零（倒挂）是经典的衰退先行信号。剥离期限溢价的线条避免把低期限溢价导致的平坦化（如 2022–24）误读为衰退信号。阴影为 NBER 衰退期。") }}
        </h3>
        <div>{{ chart_curve | safe }}</div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
      {% if chart_vix_term %}
      <div class="span6">
        <h3>{{ t('Volatility regime — VIX term structure', '波动率状态 — VIX 期限结构') }}
          {{ help("VIX level (top) and the VIX/VIX3M term-structure ratio (bottom). Ratio above 1.0 = backwardation (front-month fear exceeds 3-month) — a stress / washout marker; the curve re-normalising back below 1.0 has historically been the constructive all-clear.", "VIX 水平（上）与 VIX/VIX3M 期限结构比率（下）。比率高于 1.0＝backwardation（近月恐慌高于三个月）— 是压力／恐慌底标记；曲线回落至 1.0 以下在历史上是具建设性的“警报解除”。") }}
        </h3>
        <div>{{ chart_vix_term | safe }}</div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  <!-- ===================== MARKET SNAPSHOT TILES ===================== -->
  {% if market_tiles %}
  <div class="panel span12" id="market-tiles">
    <h2>{{ t('Market snapshot', '市场快照') }}
      {{ help("The headline cross-asset levels in one glance — equities, volatility, the Treasury curve, the dollar and oil — each with its 1-day move. A quick orientation; the read and the why live in the panels below.", "一眼看尽跨资产的关键水平 — 股票、波动率、国债收益率曲线、美元与原油 — 各附其单日变动。用于快速定位；解读与原因见下方面板。") }}
    </h2>
    <div class="mtiles">
      {% for tl in market_tiles %}
      <div class="mtile">
        <div class="mtile-top"><span class="mtile-lbl">{{ tl.label }}</span><span class="mtile-tag">{{ tl.tag }}</span></div>
        <div class="mtile-val">{{ tl.level }}</div>
        <div class="mtile-chg {{ tl.tone }}">{{ tl.chg }} <span class="muted">({{ tl.pct }})</span></div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ===================== REGIME TIME MACHINE ===================== -->
  <div class="panel span12" id="time-machine">
    <h2>{{ t('⏳ Regime time machine', '⏳ 周期时光机') }}
      {{ help("Drag the playhead across ~28 years of history and the readout below rewinds the regime CORE to that day — quadrant, growth/inflation scores, signal agreement, liquidity, business-cycle position and the warning flags that were firing. (Sector, holdings & playbook panels lower down aren't stored historically, so they always show today.) Hit ▶ to play the regime forward through time and watch the quad ribbon flip at every major turn — 2008, 2020, 2022.", "拖动播放头横扫约 28 年历史，下方读数会把周期核心回退到那一天 — 象限、增长／通胀分数、信号一致度、流动性、商业周期位置，以及当天触发的预警旗。（下方的板块、持仓与剧本面板不作历史存储，故始终显示今日。）点击 ▶ 让周期随时间向前播放，看周期色带在每个重大转折处翻转 — 2008、2020、2022。") }}
    </h2>
    <div class="tm-wrap">
      <canvas id="tm-canvas" class="tm-canvas"></canvas>
      <input id="tm-range" class="tm-range" type="range" min="0" max="0" value="0"
             aria-label="Scrub regime history">
    </div>
    <div class="tm-controls">
      <button class="tm-btn tm-play" id="tm-play" aria-label="play/pause"
              title="Play / pause through time">
        <span class="tm-play-ico"></span>
      </button>
      <span class="tm-presets">
        <button class="tm-btn" data-tm-jump="now">{{ t('Now', '现在') }}</button>
        <button class="tm-btn" data-tm-jump="2022-06-16">{{ t('2022 bear', '2022 熊市') }}</button>
        <button class="tm-btn" data-tm-jump="2020-03-23">{{ t('2020 COVID', '2020 疫情') }}</button>
        <button class="tm-btn" data-tm-jump="2008-11-20">{{ t('2008 GFC', '2008 金融危机') }}</button>
      </span>
    </div>
    <div class="tm-readout">
      <div class="tm-asof">
        <span class="tm-date" id="tm-date">—</span>
        <span class="tm-state-tag is-live" id="tm-tag">—</span>
      </div>
      <div class="tm-badges">
        <span class="badge" id="tm-quad">—</span>
        <span class="badge" id="tm-trans">—</span>
        <span class="kv">{{ t('agreement', '一致度') }} <b id="tm-conf">—</b></span>
        <span class="kv">{{ t('cycle', '商业周期') }} <b id="tm-cyc">—</b></span>
        <span class="kv">{{ t('liquidity', '流动性') }} <b id="tm-liq">—</b></span>
      </div>
      <div class="tm-gauges">
        <div class="tm-gauge">
          <div class="tm-glabel"><span>{{ t('Growth', '增长') }}</span><span class="muted" id="tm-g-v">—</span></div>
          <div class="gauge"><i id="tm-g-i" style="left:50%"></i></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tm-gauge">
          <div class="tm-glabel"><span>{{ t('Inflation', '通胀') }}</span><span class="muted" id="tm-i-v">—</span></div>
          <div class="gauge"><i id="tm-i-i" style="left:50%"></i></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tm-flags" id="tm-flags"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {% if alerts %}
  <div class="panel span12">
    <h2>{{ t('Fired alerts (today)', '已触发警报（今日）') }}
      {{ help("Alerts fire only when something CHANGES — a warning level escalating, a crossing, a sign flip — never just because a level is high. They're rare by design; read every one. Click any alert to jump to the scorecard it came from.", "警报只在某物发生变化时触发 — 预警级别升级、出现交叉、符号翻转 — 绝不仅因某个水平偏高而触发。它们刻意设计得稀少；每一条都要读。点击任意警报可跳转到其来源的计分卡。") }}
    </h2>
    {% for a in alerts %}
      <a class="alert alert-{{ a.severity }}" {% if a.anchor %}href="#{{ a.anchor }}"{% endif %}>
        <div class="alert-head">
          <span class="alert-ico">{{ a.icon }}</span>
          <b><span class="l-en">{{ a.plain_en }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ a.plain_zh }}</span></b>
          {% if a.anchor %}<span class="alert-jump">{{ t('View scorecard ↓', '查看计分卡 ↓') }}</span>{% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="alert-detail"><span class="l-en">{{ a.message }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ a.message_zh or a.message }}</span></div>
        <div class="alert-what"><span class="l-en">{{ a.what_en }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ a.what_zh }}</span></div>
        {% if a.edge_en %}<div class="alert-edge"><b>{{ t('Conviction:', '可信度：') }}</b> <span class="l-en">{{ a.edge_en }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ a.edge_zh or a.edge_en }}</span></div>{% endif %}
      </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ============ MACRO NOWCAST · CONDITIONS · RISK APPETITE ============ -->
  {% if latest.dislocation %}
  {% set DL = latest.dislocation %}
  {% set DI = DL.inputs %}
  {% set vcolor = 'var(--up)' if DL.verdict=='buyable_washout' else ('var(--down)' if DL.verdict=='stand_aside' else 'var(--muted)') %}
  <div class="panel span12{% if DL.dislocation_active %} dislo-lit{% endif %}" id="dislocation"{% if DL.dislocation_active %} style="--lit:{{ vcolor }}"{% endif %}>
    <h2>🚦 {{ t('Dislocation Gate-1 · buyable washout vs falling knife', '错位一道闸 · 可买入错杀 对 接飞刀') }}
      {{ help("A risk FILTER that sits in FRONT of the capitulation gauge: when a stress dislocation hits (VIX panic, a >10% drawdown, a variance-premium extreme or VIX backwardation), it asks ONE question — is the Fed put present? PUT-ABSENT = a recession is underway (real-time Sahm >= 0.50) OR inflation locks the Fed (sustained 10y breakeven >= 2.5%). The whole edge is in REFUSING the falling knife (2000/2008/2022), not in catching the bounce — measured on SPY 1997-2026, see research/DISLOCATION_VALIDATION.md.", "位于恐慌触底指标之前的风险过滤器：当压力错位出现（VIX 恐慌、>10% 回撤、方差溢价极端或 VIX 倒挂）时，它只问一个问题 — 美联储托底是否在位？托底缺失＝衰退进行中（实时 Sahm ≥ 0.50）或通胀锁住美联储（持续十年期盈亏平衡 ≥ 2.5%）。全部优势在于拒绝接飞刀（2000／2008／2022），而非抄到反弹 — 基于标普 1997-2026 实测。") }}
    </h2>
    <p class="muted sm" style="margin:-4px 0 10px">{{ t('A risk filter, not a buy signal. The edge is in refusing the knife, not catching the bounce — judged on drawdown, not return.', '这是风险过滤器而非买入信号。优势在于拒绝接飞刀，而非抄到反弹 — 以回撤而非回报衡量。') }}</p>
    <div class="grid">

      <!-- verdict hero -->
      <div class="span6" style="background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:3px solid {{ vcolor }};border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px">
        <div style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:{{ vcolor }}">
          {% if DL.verdict=='buyable_washout' %}{{ t('Buyable washout', '可买入的错杀') }}
          {% elif DL.verdict=='stand_aside' %}{{ t('Stand aside — falling knife', '观望 — 接飞刀风险') }}
          {% else %}{{ t('No acute dislocation', '无急性错位') }}{% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="muted sm" style="margin-top:6px">
          {% if DL.verdict=='buyable_washout' %}{{ t('A stress dislocation with the Fed put intact (no recession, inflation not blocking easing). Historically these mean-revert with shallower median drawdown — confirm into stabilization, do not anticipate.', '压力错位且美联储托底在位（无衰退、通胀不阻碍宽松）。历史上此类回归均值且中位回撤更浅 — 在企稳中确认，勿提前抢跑。') }}
          {% elif DL.verdict=='stand_aside' %}{{ t('A stress dislocation with the Fed put ABSENT. This is the 2000/2008/2022 regime where the same capitulation signals kept falling.', '压力错位且美联储托底缺失。这是 2000／2008／2022 情形，同样的恐慌信号仍持续下跌。') }}
          {% else %}{{ t('Markets are not in a stress washout — the filter is dormant and lights up only on a real dislocation.', '市场未处于压力抛售 — 过滤器休眠，仅在真正错位时点亮。') }}{% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Fed-put master switch -->
      <div class="span6" style="background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px">
        {% set pcolor = 'var(--up)' if DL.fed_put else 'var(--down)' %}
        <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px">{{ t('Fed-put master switch', '美联储托底主开关') }}
          {{ help("The one out-of-sample-stable discriminator (holds in BOTH 1997-2011 and 2012-2025). PUT-ABSENT = recession underway (Sahm >= 0.50) OR inflation locks the Fed (sustained 10y breakeven >= 2.5%). Primary trend is shown as context but adds little on top of the switch.", "唯一在样本外稳定的判别器（1997-2011 与 2012-2025 两半区均成立）。托底缺失＝衰退进行中（Sahm ≥ 0.50）或通胀锁住美联储（持续十年期盈亏平衡 ≥ 2.5%）。主趋势作为背景显示，但在开关之上增益有限。") }}
        </div>
        <div style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:{{ pcolor }}">
          {% if DL.fed_put %}{{ t('Put present', '托底在位') }}{% else %}{{ t('Put ABSENT', '托底缺失') }}{% endif %}</div>
        <div class="muted sm" style="margin-top:5px">Sahm <b>{{ '%.2f'|format(DI.sahm) if DI.sahm is not none else '—' }}</b>
          · {{ t('10y breakeven', '十年盈亏平衡') }} <b>{{ '%.2f'|format(DI.breakeven_10y_1m) if DI.breakeven_10y_1m is not none else '—' }}%</b>
          · {{ t('trend', '趋势') }} <b>{{ t('up', '上行') if DI.primary_trend=='up' else t('down', '下行') }}</b></div>
        {% if not DL.fed_put %}
        <div class="sm" style="margin-top:5px;color:var(--down)">
          {% if DI.sahm is not none and DI.sahm >= 0.5 %}⚑ {{ t('recession underway (Sahm)', '衰退进行中（Sahm）') }}{% endif %}
          {% if DI.breakeven_10y_1m is not none and DI.breakeven_10y_1m >= 2.5 %}{% if DI.sahm is not none and DI.sahm >= 0.5 %} · {% endif %}⚑ {{ t('inflation locks the Fed', '通胀锁住美联储') }}{% endif %}
        </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      {% if DL.dislocation_active %}
      <div class="span12" style="background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px">
        <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px">{{ t('Stress triggers firing', '触发的压力信号') }}</div>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px">
          {% if DI.vix is not none and DI.vix > 30 %}<span class="badge" style="font-size:11px">{{ t('VIX panic', 'VIX 恐慌') }} {{ DI.vix }}</span>{% endif %}
          {% if DI.spy_drawdown_pct is not none and DI.spy_drawdown_pct <= -10 %}<span class="badge" style="font-size:11px">{{ t('drawdown', '回撤') }} {{ DI.spy_drawdown_pct }}%</span>{% endif %}
          {% if DI.vrp_pctile is not none and DI.vrp_pctile > 0.9 %}<span class="badge" style="font-size:11px">{{ t('VRP extreme', 'VRP 极端') }}</span>{% endif %}
          {% if DI.vix_term is not none and DI.vix_term >= 1 %}<span class="badge" style="font-size:11px">{{ t('VIX backwardation', 'VIX 倒挂') }} {{ '%.2f'|format(DI.vix_term) }}</span>{% endif %}
          {% if DI.capitulation_active %}<span class="badge" style="font-size:11px;color:var(--up)">{{ t('capitulation', '恐慌触底') }} {{ DI.capitulation_signals|length }}{% if DI.capitulation_strong %} ⚑{% endif %}</span>{% endif %}
        </div>
        {% if DL.capitulation_caveat %}
        <div class="sm" style="margin-top:7px;color:var(--down)">⚠ {{ t('The capitulation gauge is firing, but the Fed put is absent — its measured bounce does NOT apply here (the falling-knife regime).', '恐慌触底指标在触发，但美联储托底缺失 — 其实测反弹在此不适用（接飞刀情形）。') }}</div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if DL.catalyst_narrative %}
      {% set CN = DL.catalyst_narrative %}
      {% set cncolor = 'var(--up)' if CN.agreement=='corroborates' else '#d98a00' %}
      <div class="span12" style="background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:3px solid {{ cncolor }};border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px">
        <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px">🧠 {{ t('Catalyst cross-check', '催化交叉验证') }}
          {{ help("An AI read of the actual catalyst TEXT (engine/catalyst_tone.py, DeepSeek) cross-checked against the Fed-put switch: does the document read as a reversible washout or a structural break? CONTEXT ONLY — it never changes the verdict; the validated gate governs. Shown only on an active dislocation when the read is confidence-passed and quote-verified.", "对实际催化文本的 AI 解读（engine/catalyst_tone.py，DeepSeek）与美联储托底开关的交叉验证：文档解读为可逆抛售还是结构性断裂？仅供背景 —— 绝不改变判定，以经验证的一道闸为准。仅在活跃错位且解读通过置信度与引文核验时显示。") }}
        </div>
        <div style="margin-bottom:5px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px">
          <span class="badge" style="font-size:11px;color:{{ cncolor }}">{% if CN.agreement=='corroborates' %}{{ t('corroborates', '印证') }}{% else %}{{ t('diverges', '背离') }}{% endif %}</span>
          <span class="badge" style="font-size:11px">{{ t('catalyst reads', '催化解读') }}: <span class="l-en">{{ CN.shock_reversible }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ CN.shock_reversible_zh or CN.shock_reversible }}</span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="muted sm"><span class="l-en">{{ CN.note }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ CN.note_zh or CN.note }}</span></div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if DL.geo_reversibility %}
      {% set GR = DL.geo_reversibility %}
      {% set grcolor = 'var(--up)' if GR.agreement=='corroborates' else '#d98a00' %}
      <div class="span12" style="background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:3px solid {{ grcolor }};border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px">
        <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px">🌍 {{ t('Geopolitical reversibility', '地缘可逆性') }}
          {{ help("A DETERMINISTIC reversibility cross-check from the GPR threat/act split (Caldara-Iacoviello, AER 2022): the THREAT component of geopolitical risk historically reverts (~3 months) while realized ACTS persist. The free, always-available complement to the AI catalyst cross-check above — shown only on an active dislocation when geopolitical risk is elevated (≥80th pct) and the threat/act mix has a clear lean. CONTEXT ONLY — it never changes the verdict; the validated Fed-put gate governs.", "基于 GPR 威胁／行动分量的确定性可逆性交叉验证（Caldara-Iacoviello，AER 2022）：地缘风险的「威胁」分量历史上往往回落（约3个月），而已发生的「行动」更持久。这是上方 AI 催化交叉验证的免费、始终可用的补充 —— 仅在活跃错位、地缘风险偏高（≥80百分位）且威胁／行动结构有明确倾向时显示。仅供背景 —— 绝不改变判定，以经验证的美联储托底闸为准。") }}
        </div>
        <div style="margin-bottom:5px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px">
          <span class="badge" style="font-size:11px;color:{{ grcolor }}">{% if GR.agreement=='corroborates' %}{{ t('corroborates', '印证') }}{% else %}{{ t('diverges', '背离') }}{% endif %}</span>
          <span class="badge" style="font-size:11px">{{ t('GPR reads', '地缘解读') }}: <span class="l-en">{{ GR.reversibility }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ GR.reversibility_zh or GR.reversibility }}</span> ({{ t('led by', '主导') }} {{ t('threats', '威胁') if GR.lean=='threat' else t('acts', '行动') }}{% if GR.gpr_pct is not none %}, {{ GR.gpr_pct }}{{ t('th pct', '百分位') }}{% endif %})</span>
        </div>
        <div class="muted sm"><span class="l-en">{{ GR.note }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ GR.note_zh or GR.note }}</span></div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if DL.gate2 and DL.gate2.state not in ('dormant', 'unknown') %}
      {% set g2 = DL.gate2 %}
      {% set g2color = 'var(--up)' if g2.state=='confirmed' else ('#d98a00' if g2.state=='awaiting_confirm' else 'var(--muted)') %}
      <div class="span12" style="background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:3px solid {{ g2color }};border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px">
        <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px">{{ t('Gate-2 entry timer', '二道闸 · 入场时机') }}
          {{ help("The entry TIMER — it arms ONLY once Gate-1 says buyable, and it is a coincident CONFIRM, never anticipation: it waits for the VIX term structure to un-invert (backwardation back to contango), which historically lags the VIX peak by ~13 sessions. MEASURED on matched buyable washouts (2006+): waiting for the un-inversion lifted hit-rate 61->67%, median 3-month return +2.2->+4.6% and shallowed median drawdown -4.5->-2.9% — but the 1-in-10 tail was marginally worse. A confirm, not a bottom-caller.", "入场时机器 — 仅在一道闸判定可买入后才启动，且是同步确认而非提前预判：它等待 VIX 期限结构回正（由倒挂转为正向），历史上滞后 VIX 峰值约 13 个交易日。基于匹配的可买入错杀样本（2006+）实测：等待回正将胜率由 61% 提升至 67%，三月中位回报 +2.2% 升至 +4.6%，中位回撤由 −4.5% 收窄至 −2.9% — 但 1/10 尾部略差。这是确认，而非抄底。") }}
        </div>
        <b style="color:{{ g2color }}">
          {% if g2.state=='confirmed' %}{{ t('Re-entry confirmed', '入场已确认') }}
          {% elif g2.state=='awaiting_confirm' %}{{ t('Awaiting confirm', '等待确认') }}
          {% else %}{{ t('No timer signal', '无时机信号') }}{% endif %}</b>
        <span class="muted sm"> —
          {% if g2.state=='confirmed' %}{{ t('term structure un-inverted', '期限结构已回正') }}{% if g2.hook_days_ago is not none %} ({{ g2.hook_days_ago }} {{ t('sessions ago', '个交易日前') }}){% endif %}{{ t('; the mean-reversion confirm — wait for it, do not anticipate.', '；均值回归确认 — 等待它，勿提前抢跑。') }}
          {% elif g2.state=='awaiting_confirm' %}{{ t('term structure still backwardated; wait for the un-inversion (historically ~13 sessions after the VIX peak), do not anticipate.', '期限结构仍倒挂；等待回正（历史上约在 VIX 峰值后 13 个交易日），勿提前抢跑。') }}
          {% else %}{{ t('no backwardation to un-invert — the term-structure timer does not apply; rely on Gate-1.', '无倒挂可回正 — 期限结构时机器不适用；以一道闸为准。') }}{% endif %}</span>
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      <!-- measured record (honest) -->
      <div class="span12 muted sm" style="border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:8px;margin-top:2px">
        <b>{{ t('Measured (SPY 1997-2026):', '实测（标普 1997-2026）：') }}</b> {{ t('put-present washouts had ~4pp shallower median 3-month drawdown than put-absent (95% CI [+0.3, +6.3]) — the one effect whose CI excludes zero. The larger hit-rate and 1-year-tail gaps point the same way, but their CIs span zero at ~10 effective crises, so they are carried by sign-consistency (leave-one-year-out 26/28, both split-halves), not significance. A drawdown filter, never alpha.', '托底在位的错杀其中位三月回撤比托底缺失浅约 4 个百分点（95% 置信区间 [+0.3, +6.3]）— 唯一置信区间不含零的效应。更大的胜率与一年尾部差异方向一致，但在约 10 个有效危机样本下置信区间跨零，故由符号一致性支撑（留一年法 26/28、两个样本半区），而非统计显著性。这是回撤过滤器，绝非超额收益。') }}
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  {# AI Master Brief — cross-asset LLM synthesis (engine/master_brain.py). Client-
     fetched from master_brief.json so it never depends on build order; hidden until
     a usable brief loads. Research context only — never a signal. #}
  <div class="panel span12" id="master-brief" style="display:none">
    <style>
      #master-brief .mb-sum{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 10px}
      #master-brief .mb-sec{margin:10px 0}
      #master-brief .mb-h{font-weight:600;color:var(--link);margin:0 0 4px}
      #master-brief .mb-list{margin:4px 0 0 18px;padding:0}
      #master-brief .mb-list li{margin:3px 0}
      #master-brief .mb-foot{margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}
    </style>
    <h2>🧠 {{ t('AI Master Brief · cross-asset synthesis', 'AI 主脑简报 · 跨资产综合') }}
      {{ help('An AI-generated synthesis across all six dashboards (macro, China, HK, commodities, FX, Bitcoin). RESEARCH CONTEXT only — it reads the deterministic signals and narrates the cross-asset picture, flags where they conflict, and tests the liquidity-rotation thesis; it never feeds a score, signal or allocation. Can be wrong or overconfident — verify against the underlying dashboards.', 'AI 跨六大看板（宏观、中国、香港、商品、外汇、比特币）的综合分析。仅供研究参考——它解读确定性信号、叙述跨资产全局、标注信号冲突并检验流动性轮动假设，绝不参与任何评分、信号或仓位。可能出错或过度自信，请对照各看板核实。') }}
    </h2>
    <div id="master-brief-body" class="muted sm"></div>
  </div>
  <script src="masterbrief.js"></script>

  {% if latest.conditions %}
  {% set C = latest.conditions %}
  {% set FC = C.financial_conditions %}
  {% set RC = C.recession %}
  {% set GN = C.growth_nowcast %}
  {% set IN = C.inflation_nowcast %}
  {% set RA = C.risk_appetite %}
  {% set DR = C.drawdown_risk %}
  {% set CAP = C.capitulation %}
  {% set ST = C.style_tilt %}
  {% set LN = C.labor_nowcast %}
  {% set SC = (latest.playbook or {}).scenario %}
  {% set NH = nowcast_hist or {} %}
  <div class="panel span12" id="conditions">
    <h2>🛰️ {{ t('Macro nowcast · conditions · risk appetite', '宏观即时预测 · 金融条件 · 风险偏好') }}
      {{ help("A complementary lens that runs ALONGSIDE the price-based quad and never alters it: the Fed-research feeds and option-implied risk that a markets-only model misses. Financial conditions (Chicago Fed NFCI — 105 inputs in one z-score), a 0–100 recession-risk score (Sahm rule + smoothed probability + Excess Bond Premium + a term-premium-ADJUSTED curve that strips the 2022–24 false inversion), real-time growth (Weekly Economic Index, GDPNow) and inflation (Atlanta sticky vs flexible CPI) nowcasts, and a cross-asset risk-appetite read (equity vol-risk-premium, VIX term structure, CBOE SKEW, the stock-bond correlation regime, a RORO composite). Free Fed/CBOE data — see research/QUANT_FACTOR_EXPANSION.md.", "一个与价格象限并行、绝不改变象限的补充视角：纯市场模型遗漏的美联储研究数据与期权隐含风险。金融条件（芝加哥联储 NFCI — 105 项输入合成一个 z 分数）、0–100 衰退风险评分（Sahm 法则 + 平滑概率 + 超额债券溢价 + 期限溢价调整后的收益率曲线，剔除 2022–24 的假性倒挂）、实时增长（周度经济指数、GDPNow）与通胀（亚特兰大黏性对弹性 CPI）即时预测，以及跨资产风险偏好（股票波动率风险溢价、VIX 期限结构、CBOE SKEW、股债相关性状态、RORO 综合）。免费美联储／CBOE 数据。") }}
    </h2>
    <p class="muted sm" style="margin:-4px 0 10px">{{ t('Complementary to the quad above — it does not change the regime label; agreement strengthens conviction, divergence is a heads-up.', '与上方象限互补 — 不改变周期标签；一致则增强信心，背离则为提醒。') }}</p>
    <p class="sm" style="margin:-4px 0 12px">📈 {{ t('These macro-risk signals drive the', '这些宏观风险信号驱动') }} <a href="spvector.html" style="font-weight:700">{{ t('S&P / Macro Vector allocation', '标普／宏观向量配置') }} →</a> {{ t('— when to hold the broad US index vs T-bills.', '——何时持有美国大盘指数、何时转入短债。') }}</p>
    <div class="grid">

      <!-- Financial conditions -->
      <div class="span6" style="background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px">
        <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px">{{ t('Financial conditions', '金融条件') }} <span class="muted sm">NFCI</span>
          {{ help("How easy or hard it is to borrow and trade across the whole US financial system — the Chicago Fed's NFCI distils 105 money-market, debt, equity and shadow-banking indicators into one number. 0 = average; NEGATIVE = looser/easier than normal (a tailwind for risk assets); POSITIVE = tighter (a headwind). The percentile shows where today ranks against the last 5 years.", "在整个美国金融体系中借贷与交易的难易程度 — 芝加哥联储 NFCI 将 105 项指标合成一个数。0＝平均；负＝比平常更宽松（风险资产顺风）；正＝更紧（逆风）。百分位表示今日在近五年中的排名。") }}</div>
        {% if FC.nfci is not none %}
        {% set fcolor = 'var(--up)' if FC.state=='loose' else ('var(--down)' if FC.state=='tight' else 'var(--muted)') %}
        <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:{{ fcolor }}">{{ '%+.2f'|format(FC.nfci) }}
          <span class="badge" style="font-size:11px;vertical-align:middle">{{ t(FC.state, {'loose':'宽松','tight':'收紧','neutral':'中性'}.get(FC.state, FC.state)) }}{% if FC.trend %} · {{ t(FC.trend, {'tightening':'收紧中','loosening':'宽松中'}.get(FC.trend, FC.trend)) }}{% endif %}</span></div>
        <div class="muted sm" style="margin-top:4px">{{ t('Easier than', '比') }} {{ ((1-FC.nfci_pctile)*100)|round|int if FC.nfci_pctile is not none else '—' }}% {{ t('of the past 5 years', '的近五年更宽松') }}</div>
        {% if FC.subindices %}
        <details class="jarg"><summary>{{ t("what's driving it", '驱动因素') }}</summary>
          <div class="jbody">
            {% set _sub = {'nfci_risk': ('Risk', '风险', 'Volatility & funding stress — how nervous markets are.', '波动与融资压力 — 市场有多紧张。'),
                           'nfci_credit': ('Credit', '信用', 'How cheaply & freely firms and households can borrow.', '企业与家庭借贷的便宜与顺畅程度。'),
                           'nfci_leverage': ('Leverage', '杠杆', 'How much debt & margin is built up in the system.', '系统中累积的债务与保证金规模。')} %}
            {% for k,v in FC.subindices.items() %}{% set m = _sub.get(k) %}{% if m %}
            <div class="jrow"><span class="jk">{{ t(m[0], m[1]) }}</span><span class="jv">{{ t(m[2], m[3]) }}</span><span class="jn" style="color:{{ 'var(--down)' if v>0.05 else ('var(--up)' if v<-0.05 else 'var(--muted)') }}">{{ '%+.2f'|format(v) }}</span></div>
            {% endif %}{% endfor %}
            <div class="muted" style="font-size:10px;margin-top:5px">{{ t('+ = tightening contribution · − = loosening', '正＝收紧贡献 · 负＝宽松贡献') }}</div>
          </div>
        </details>{% endif %}
        {% else %}<div class="muted">—</div>{% endif %}
      </div>

      <!-- Systemic stress (OFR FSI decomposition) -->
      {% set SS = C.systemic_stress %}
      {% if SS and SS.ofr_fsi is not none %}
      <div class="span6" style="background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px">
        <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px">{{ t('Systemic stress', '系统性压力') }} <span class="muted sm">OFR FSI</span>
          {{ help("The OFR Financial Stress Index — a daily gauge built from 33 global market variables. 0 = average stress since 2000; NEGATIVE = calmer than normal, POSITIVE = stressed. Unlike NFCI it splits the reading into five CHANNELS (credit, equity valuation, safe assets, funding, volatility) and three regions (US, other-advanced, EM), so you can see WHERE stress is coming from — the funding leg captures offshore-dollar / cross-currency-basis strain. It is a COINCIDENT gauge: it confirms and explains stress, it does not forecast it. Free OFR data — see research/DATA_SIGNAL_EXPANSION_2026.md.", "OFR 金融压力指数 — 由 33 个全球市场变量构成的每日指标。0＝2000 年以来的平均压力；负＝比平常更平静，正＝有压力。与 NFCI 不同，它把读数拆为五个渠道（信用、股票估值、避险资产、融资、波动）与三个地区（美国、其他发达、新兴市场），可看出压力来自何处 — 融资项捕捉离岸美元/交叉货币基差紧张。这是同步指标：确认并解释压力，而非预测。免费 OFR 数据。") }}</div>
        {% set scolor = 'var(--down)' if SS.state in ('elevated','acute') else ('var(--up)' if SS.state=='calm' else 'var(--muted)') %}
        <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:{{ scolor }}">{{ '%+.2f'|format(SS.ofr_fsi) }}
          <span class="badge" style="font-size:11px;vertical-align:middle">{{ t(SS.state, {'calm':'平静','normal':'一般','elevated':'偏高','acute':'急性'}.get(SS.state, SS.state)) }}{% if SS.trend %} · {{ t(SS.trend, {'rising':'上升中','easing':'缓和中'}.get(SS.trend, SS.trend)) }}{% endif %}</span></div>
        <div class="muted sm" style="margin-top:4px">{{ t('More stressed than', '压力高于') }} {{ (SS.ofr_fsi_pctile*100)|round|int if SS.ofr_fsi_pctile is not none else '—' }}% {{ t('of the past 5 years', '的近五年') }}{% if SS.leading_driver %} · {{ t('led by', '主导渠道') }} {{ SS.leading_driver }}{% endif %}</div>
        {% if SS.functional %}
        <details class="jarg"><summary>{{ t('stress by channel', '分渠道压力') }}</summary>
          <div class="jbody">
            {% set _fl = {'credit': ('Credit', '信用', 'Corporate / credit-market stress.', '企业／信用市场压力。'),
                          'equity_valuation': ('Equity valuation', '股票估值', 'Equity drawdown & valuation stress.', '股票回撤与估值压力。'),
                          'safe_assets': ('Safe assets', '避险资产', 'Flight-to-safety demand for Treasuries.', '对国债的避险需求。'),
                          'funding': ('Funding', '融资', 'Money-market & offshore-dollar (x-ccy basis) funding stress.', '货币市场与离岸美元（交叉货币基差）融资压力。'),
                          'volatility': ('Volatility', '波动', 'Cross-asset implied / realized volatility.', '跨资产隐含／已实现波动。')} %}
            {% for k,v in SS.functional.items() %}{% set m = _fl.get(k) %}{% if m %}
            <div class="jrow"><span class="jk">{{ t(m[0], m[1]) }}</span><span class="jv">{{ t(m[2], m[3]) }}</span><span class="jn" style="color:{{ 'var(--down)' if v>0.05 else ('var(--up)' if v<-0.05 else 'var(--muted)') }}">{{ '%+.2f'|format(v) }}</span></div>
            {% endif %}{% endfor %}
            {% if SS.regional %}<div class="muted" style="font-size:10px;margin-top:5px">{{ t('By region', '分地区') }}: {% for k,v in SS.regional.items() %}{{ {'united_states':'US','other_advanced':t('Adv','发达'),'emerging_markets':'EM'}.get(k,k) }} {{ '%+.2f'|format(v) }}{% if not loop.last %} · {% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>{% endif %}
            {% if SS.a2p2_spread_bps is not none or SS.cp_bill_spread_bps is not none %}
            <div class="jrow" style="margin-top:5px"><span class="jk">{{ t('CP spreads', '商票利差') }}</span><span class="jv">{{ t('Commercial-paper credit-quality (A2/P2−AA) & funding (CP−bill) stress.', '商业票据信用质量（A2/P2−AA）与融资（票据−国库券）压力。') }}</span><span class="jn">{% if SS.a2p2_spread_bps is not none %}A2/P2 {{ SS.a2p2_spread_bps|round|int }}bp{% endif %}{% if SS.cp_bill_spread_bps is not none %} · {{ t('CP-bill', '票据') }} {{ SS.cp_bill_spread_bps|round|int }}bp{% endif %}</span></div>{% endif %}
            <div class="muted" style="font-size:10px;margin-top:5px">{{ t('+ = stress contribution · − = calm. A coincident gauge that names the channel — not a timing trigger.', '正＝压力贡献 · 负＝平静。同步指标，用于指明渠道 — 非择时触发器。') }}</div>
          </div>
        </details>{% endif %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      <!-- Recession risk -->
      <div class="span6" style="background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px">
        <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px">{{ t('Recession risk', '衰退风险') }}
          {{ help("A 0–100 score for how close the US economy is to recession, blending four respected signals (the breakdown is under 'what's behind it'). LOW today means the expansion looks intact; it climbs months before a downturn, not on the day. A risk gauge, not a market-timing trigger.", "美国经济离衰退有多近的 0–100 评分，融合四个公认信号（拆解见'背后构成'）。今日低位意味着扩张看起来完好；它在衰退前数月就上升，而非当天。这是风险指标，而非择时触发器。") }}</div>
        {% if RC.score is not none %}
        {% set rcolor = 'var(--down)' if RC.label=='high' else ('#d98a00' if RC.label=='elevated' else 'var(--up)') %}
        <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:{{ rcolor }}">{{ RC.score|round|int }}<span class="muted" style="font-size:13px">/100</span>
          <span class="badge" style="font-size:11px;vertical-align:middle">{{ t(RC.label, {'low':'低','elevated':'偏高','high':'高'}.get(RC.label, RC.label)) }}</span></div>
        <div style="height:7px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--line);margin:7px 0;overflow:hidden"><div style="height:100%;width:{{ RC.score|round|int }}%;background:{{ rcolor }}"></div></div>
        <details class="jarg"><summary>{{ t("what's behind it", '背后构成') }}</summary>
          <div class="jbody">
            <div class="jrow"><span class="jk">Sahm</span><span class="jv">{{ t('The Sahm rule — unemployment rising off its lows (≥0.50). Shown for context; the scored labor leg is jobless claims (it leads Sahm and tested stronger vs NBER).', '萨姆规则 — 失业率从低位回升（≥0.50）。此处为参考；评分采用的劳动力指标为申领失业金（领先萨姆规则，对 NBER 历史检验更强）。') }}</span><span class="jn">{{ '%.2f'|format(RC.sahm) if RC.sahm is not none else '—' }}</span></div>
            <div class="jrow"><span class="jk">{{ t('NY Fed prob','纽约联储概率') }}</span><span class="jv">{{ t('Model odds of recession within 12 months (from the yield curve).', '未来 12 个月衰退的模型概率（源自收益率曲线）。') }}</span><span class="jn">{{ '%.0f'|format(RC.ny_fed_prob) if RC.ny_fed_prob is not none else '—' }}%</span></div>
            <div class="jrow"><span class="jk">EBP</span><span class="jv">{{ t('Excess Bond Premium — fear priced into corporate credit beyond default risk. Above 0 = stress.', '超额债券溢价 — 企业信用中超出违约风险的恐惧定价。大于 0＝压力。') }}</span><span class="jn">{{ '%+.2f'|format(RC.ebp) if RC.ebp is not none else '—' }}</span></div>
            {% if RC.curve_note %}<div class="jrow"><span class="jk">{{ t('Curve','曲线') }}</span><span class="jv">{{ t('10y minus 3m slope — inverted (negative) has preceded most recessions; we adjust it for term premium to strip the 2022–24 false alarm.', '十年期减三个月斜率 — 倒挂（负）曾领先多数衰退；我们对其做期限溢价调整以剔除 2022–24 的假警报。') }}</span><span class="jn">{{ '%+.2f'|format(RC.curve_raw) if RC.curve_raw is not none else '—' }}→{{ '%+.2f'|format(RC.curve_tp_adjusted) if RC.curve_tp_adjusted is not none else '—' }}</span></div>{% endif %}
            {% if RC.components and RC.components.claims is not none %}<div class="jrow"><span class="jk">{{ t('Jobless claims','申领失业金') }}</span><span class="jv">{{ t('4-week-average initial claims surging vs a year ago — a leading labor signal that turns before the unemployment rate (validated vs NBER).', '首次申领失业金4周均值同比飙升 — 领先于失业率的劳动力信号（已对 NBER 验证）。') }}</span><span class="jn">{{ '%.0f'|format(RC.components.claims) }}/100</span></div>{% endif %}
          </div>
        </details>
        {% if DR and DR.score is not none %}
        {% set dcolor = 'var(--down)' if DR.band in ('high','extreme') else ('#d98a00' if DR.band=='elevated' else 'var(--muted)') %}
        <div class="kv" style="margin-top:7px;padding-top:7px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)">{{ t('Macro-stress (drawdown risk)', '宏观压力（回撤风险）') }}
          {{ help("A LEAN 4-factor macro-stress composite (recession-risk + NFCI + Excess Bond Premium + HY credit spreads; the weak curve/VIX legs were dropped after measurement). It is a DRAWDOWN-RISK gauge, not a return forecast: at the HIGH band the S&P had a ~36% chance of a >10% drawdown over the next 3 months vs ~8% base rate — the cleanest drawdown discriminator we measured (beats quad==Q4 and net-liquidity). Returns still rebound, so this says 'size down / widen stops', not 'sell everything'.", "精简版四因子宏观压力综合（衰退风险＋NFCI＋超额债券溢价＋高收益信用利差；曲线/VIX 经测量后剔除）。这是回撤风险指标而非回报预测：在高位区，标普未来三个月出现 >10% 回撤的概率约 36%（基准约 8%）。") }}
          <b style="float:right;color:{{ dcolor }}">{{ DR.score|round|int }}/100 · {{ t(DR.band, {'low':'低','elevated':'偏高','high':'高','extreme':'极高'}.get(DR.band, DR.band)) }}</b></div>
        <div class="muted sm">{{ t('Chance of a >10% S&P fall in 3 months:', '标普三月内下跌超 10% 的概率：') }} <b style="color:{{ dcolor }}">~{{ DR.dd10_prob_pct }}%</b> <span class="muted">{{ t('(vs ~8% normally)', '（平常约 8%）') }}</span></div>
        {% endif %}
        {% else %}<div class="muted">—</div>{% endif %}
      </div>

      <!-- Growth & inflation nowcast -->
      <div class="span6" style="background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px">
        <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px">{{ t('Growth & inflation nowcast', '增长与通胀即时预测') }}
          <span class="muted" style="font-weight:400;font-size:11px">· {{ t('hover a metric for its history', '悬停指标查看历史') }}</span></div>

        <div class="kv">
          <span class="hovchart">{{ t('Weekly Economic Index', '周度经济指数') }}<span class="tip">
            <span class="nph"><span class="l-en">Weekly Economic Index</span><span class="l-zh">周度经济指数</span></span>
            <span class="l-en"> — a real-time read on US growth from 10 weekly series (retail, hours, claims, fuel, steel…), scaled to GDP-growth terms. Updates every Thursday, so it sees turns months before quarterly GDP.</span><span class="l-zh"> — 由 10 个周度序列（零售、工时、申领、燃料、钢铁…）合成的实时美国增长读数，换算到 GDP 增速口径。每周四更新，比季度 GDP 提前数月见到拐点。</span>
            {{ nchart(NH.wei) }}</span></span>
          <b>{{ '%.1f'|format(GN.wei) if GN.wei is not none else '—' }}%</b> {{ trendword(NH.wei) }}</div>

        <div class="kv">
          <span class="hovchart">{{ t('GDPNow (Atlanta Fed)', 'GDPNow') }}<span class="tip">
            <span class="nph"><span class="l-en">GDPNow — Atlanta Fed</span><span class="l-zh">GDPNow — 亚特兰大联储</span></span>
            <span class="l-en"> — the Atlanta Fed's running estimate of the CURRENT quarter's GDP growth, rebuilt after every data release. Not a forecast — a nowcast of the quarter in progress.</span><span class="l-zh"> — 亚特兰大联储对当前季度 GDP 增速的滚动估计，每次数据发布后重算。不是预测，而是对进行中季度的即时测算。</span>
            {{ nchart(NH.gdpnow) }}</span></span>
          <b>{{ '%.1f'|format(GN.gdpnow) if GN.gdpnow is not none else '—' }}%</b> {{ trendword(NH.gdpnow) }}</div>

        {% if IN.sticky_ann is not none %}<div class="kv" style="margin-top:4px">
          <span class="hovchart">{{ t('Sticky CPI (persistent)', '黏性 CPI（持续性）') }}<span class="tip">
            <span class="nph"><span class="l-en">Sticky-price CPI</span><span class="l-zh">黏性价格 CPI</span></span>
            <span class="l-en"> — inflation in prices that change SLOWLY (rent, services, insurance). Because they reset infrequently, they capture the persistent, hard-to-shift core of inflation — what the Fed watches.</span><span class="l-zh"> — 调价缓慢的商品价格（房租、服务、保险）。因为很少重设，它们刻画了顽固、难以撼动的通胀核心 — 美联储紧盯的部分。</span>
            {{ nchart(NH.sticky) }}</span></span>
          <b>{{ '%.1f'|format(IN.sticky_ann) }}%</b> {{ trendword(NH.sticky) }}</div>{% endif %}

        {% if IN.flexible_ann is not none %}<div class="kv">
          <span class="hovchart">{{ t('Flexible CPI (transitory)', '弹性 CPI（暂时性）') }}<span class="tip">
            <span class="nph"><span class="l-en">Flexible-price CPI</span><span class="l-zh">弹性价格 CPI</span></span>
            <span class="l-en"> — inflation in prices that move FAST (gas, food, cars). It's noisy and mean-reverting — big swings here are usually transitory, so a flexible-led spike fades faster than a sticky-led one.</span><span class="l-zh"> — 变动迅速的商品价格（汽油、食品、汽车）。噪声大、均值回归 — 这里的大幅波动通常是暂时的，弹性主导的飙升比黏性主导的消退更快。</span>
            {{ nchart(NH.flexible) }}</span></span>
          <b>{{ '%.1f'|format(IN.flexible_ann) }}%</b> {{ trendword(NH.flexible) }}</div>{% endif %}

        {% if IN.read %}<div class="muted sm" style="margin-top:6px;padding-top:6px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)">{{ t('Read:', '判读：') }} <b>{{ t(IN.read, {'persistent (sticky-led)':'持续性（黏性主导）','transitory (flexible-led)':'暂时性（弹性主导）'}.get(IN.read, IN.read)) }}</b>
          {{ help("Which side of inflation is running hotter right now. 'Transitory (flexible-led)' = the gap is driven by the FAST, noisy prices (gas/food/cars), which tend to mean-revert — so this kind of inflation usually fades on its own. 'Persistent (sticky-led)' = the SLOW prices (rent/services) are leading, which is stubborn and what forces the Fed's hand. It compares the two nowcasts above; it is a read on the MIX, not a forecast of the level.", "现在通胀的哪一侧更热。'暂时性（弹性主导）'＝差距由快速、噪声大的价格（汽油/食品/汽车）驱动，往往均值回归，所以这类通胀通常自行消退。'持续性（黏性主导）'＝缓慢价格（房租/服务）领先，顽固且最终迫使美联储行动。它比较上面两个即时预测，判读的是结构而非水平的预测。") }}</div>{% endif %}
      </div>

      <!-- Labor & real-activity nowcast (leading; front-runs payrolls) -->
      {% if LN %}
      <div class="span6" style="background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px">
        <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px">{{ t('Labor & real activity', '劳动力与实体活动') }}
          {{ help("High-frequency, LEADING reads on the real economy that front-run the monthly (and heavily revised) jobs report. Weekly jobless claims (rising = more layoffs), Indeed job postings (labor DEMAND), and the daily withheld income & employment taxes deposited at the Treasury (a near-real-time read on total wages — very hard to game). They turn months before payrolls confirm. Free FRED / Treasury / SF Fed data — see research/REAL_ACTIVITY_NOWCAST.md.", "对实体经济的高频领先读数，抢在月度（且大幅修正）的就业报告之前。每周首次申领失业金（上升＝裁员增多）、Indeed 招聘职位（劳动力需求）、以及财政部每日预扣所得与就业税存款（对总工资的近实时读数，极难操纵）。它们比非农数据提前数月转向。免费 FRED／财政部／旧金山联储数据。") }}
          <span class="muted" style="font-weight:400;font-size:11px">· {{ t('leads payrolls', '领先非农') }}</span></div>

        {% if LN.initial_claims_4wk is not none %}
        {% set _ccol = 'var(--down)' if LN.claims_trend=='rising' else 'var(--up)' %}
        <div class="kv">{{ t('Initial claims (4wk avg)', '首次申领（4周均）') }}
          <b>{{ (LN.initial_claims_4wk/1000)|round|int }}k</b>
          {% if LN.claims_yoy_pct is not none %}<span class="sm" style="color:{{ _ccol }}">{{ '%+.0f'|format(LN.claims_yoy_pct) }}% y/y {{ '▲' if LN.claims_trend=='rising' else '▼' }}</span>{% endif %}</div>{% endif %}

        {% if LN.continued_claims is not none %}<div class="kv">{{ t('Continued claims', '续领失业金') }} <b>{{ '%.2f'|format(LN.continued_claims/1000000) }}M</b></div>{% endif %}

        {% if LN.indeed_postings is not none %}
        {% set _icol = 'var(--up)' if LN.indeed_trend=='rising' else 'var(--down)' %}
        <div class="kv">{{ t('Indeed job postings', 'Indeed 招聘职位') }}
          <b>{{ '%.0f'|format(LN.indeed_postings) }}</b>
          {% if LN.indeed_chg_3m_pct is not none %}<span class="sm" style="color:{{ _icol }}">{{ '%+.1f'|format(LN.indeed_chg_3m_pct) }}%/3mo {{ '▲' if LN.indeed_trend=='rising' else '▼' }}</span>{% endif %}</div>{% endif %}

        {% if LN.withheld_tax_yoy_pct is not none %}
        {% set _wcol = 'var(--up)' if LN.income_trend=='rising' else 'var(--down)' %}
        <div class="kv">{{ t('Withheld income taxes', '预扣所得税') }}
          {{ help("Income & employment taxes deposited daily at the Treasury straight from paychecks. The trailing-3-month total vs a year ago is a near-real-time read on total WAGE income — hard to manipulate, and it leads the payroll report.", "每日从工资中直接缴入财政部的所得与就业税。近三个月合计同比是对总工资收入的近实时读数 — 难以操纵，且领先非农报告。") }}
          <b style="color:{{ _wcol }}">{{ '%+.1f'|format(LN.withheld_tax_yoy_pct) }}%</b> <span class="muted sm">y/y</span></div>{% endif %}

        {% if LN.read %}
        {% set _rcol = 'var(--up)' if LN.read=='labor firm' else ('var(--down)' if LN.read=='labor cooling' else 'var(--muted)') %}
        <div class="muted sm" style="margin-top:6px;padding-top:6px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)">{{ t('Read:', '判读：') }}
          <b style="color:{{ _rcol }}">{{ t(LN.read, {'labor firm':'劳动力稳健','labor cooling':'劳动力降温','labor mixed':'劳动力分化'}.get(LN.read, LN.read)) }}</b></div>{% endif %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      <!-- Risk appetite -->
      <div class="span6" style="background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px">
        <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px">{{ t('Risk appetite (cross-asset)', '风险偏好（跨资产）') }}</div>
        {% if RA.roro is not none %}
        {% set rocolor = 'var(--up)' if RA.roro_state=='risk-on' else ('var(--down)' if RA.roro_state=='risk-off' else 'var(--muted)') %}
        <div class="kv">RORO <b style="color:{{ rocolor }}">{{ '%+.2f'|format(RA.roro) }}</b> <span class="badge" style="font-size:11px">{{ t(RA.roro_state, {'risk-on':'风险偏好','risk-off':'避险','neutral':'中性'}.get(RA.roro_state, RA.roro_state)) }}</span></div>
        {% set RC = fear_euphoria.confirmation if (fear_euphoria and fear_euphoria.confirmation) else none %}
        {% if RC %}
        {% set _dcol = 'var(--up)' if RC.direction=='risk-on' else ('var(--down)' if RC.direction=='risk-off' else 'var(--muted)') %}
        <div class="kv" style="margin-top:5px;padding-top:5px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)">{{ t('Cross-asset confirmation', '跨资产确认') }}
          {{ help("How many of the 7 cross-asset RORO legs (VIX, HY credit, SKEW, vol term structure, financial conditions, copper/gold, the dollar) agree on the dominant risk direction RIGHT NOW — the dispersion the single RORO mean hides. A 5-of-7 split and a unanimous read can average to the same number; this shows which it is. The full 7-leg bar breakdown is in the Fear↔Euphoria panel below. DISPLAY-ONLY: it never scores or sizes anything.", "7 项跨资产 RORO 分量（VIX、高收益信用、SKEW、波动率期限结构、金融条件、铜／金、美元）当前有多少项在主导风险方向上一致 — 这是单一 RORO 均值掩盖的离散度。5/7 的分歧与全体一致可能平均成同一数字；此处揭示究竟是哪种。完整 7 项柱状拆解见下方恐惧↔欣喜面板。仅供显示：绝不评分或决定仓位。") }}
          <b style="color:{{ _dcol }}">{{ RC.agree }}/{{ RC.total }}</b>
          <span class="muted sm">{{ t('legs', '项') }} {{ t(RC.direction, {'risk-on':'偏好风险','risk-off':'避险','split':'对半'}.get(RC.direction, RC.direction)) }}</span>
          <span class="badge" style="font-size:11px">{{ t(RC.verdict_en, RC.verdict_zh) }}</span></div>
        {% if RC.dissent %}
        <div class="muted sm" style="margin-top:2px">{{ t('dissent', '背离') }}: {% for d in RC.dissent %}{{ t(d.en, d.zh) }}{% if not loop.last %} · {% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>
        {% else %}
        <div class="muted sm" style="margin-top:2px">{{ t('all legs aligned', '全部分量一致') }}</div>
        {% endif %}
        {% endif %}
        {% endif %}
        {% if RA.vrp is not none %}<div class="kv">{{ t('Equity vol-risk-premium', '股票波动率风险溢价') }} <b>{{ '%+.1f'|format(RA.vrp) }}</b> <span class="muted sm">{{ ((RA.vrp_pctile or 0)*100)|round|int }}%ile</span></div>{% endif %}
        {% if RA.vix_term is not none %}<div class="kv">{{ t('VIX term structure', 'VIX 期限结构') }} <b>{{ '%.2f'|format(RA.vix_term) }}</b> <span class="muted sm">{{ t('backwardation' if RA.vix_term>=1 else 'contango', '倒挂' if RA.vix_term>=1 else '正向') }}</span></div>{% endif %}
        {% if RA.skew is not none %}<div class="kv">{{ t('CBOE SKEW (tail)', 'CBOE SKEW（尾部）') }} <b>{{ RA.skew|round|int }}</b> <span class="muted sm">{{ ((RA.skew_pctile or 0)*100)|round|int }}%ile</span></div>{% endif %}
        {% if RA.stock_bond_corr is not none %}
        {% set sbcolor = 'var(--down)' if 'breakdown' in (RA.stock_bond_regime or '') else 'var(--muted)' %}
        <div class="kv">{{ t('Stock-bond corr', '股债相关性') }} <b style="color:{{ sbcolor }}">{{ '%+.2f'|format(RA.stock_bond_corr) }}</b> <span class="muted sm">{{ t('bonds not hedging' if 'breakdown' in (RA.stock_bond_regime or '') else ('bonds hedge' if 'diversifying' in (RA.stock_bond_regime or '') else 'mixed'), '债券未对冲' if 'breakdown' in (RA.stock_bond_regime or '') else ('债券对冲' if 'diversifying' in (RA.stock_bond_regime or '') else '混合')) }}</span></div>{% endif %}
        {% if RA.vol_target_scalar is not none %}<div class="kv">{{ t('Vol-target exposure', '波动率目标敞口') }} <b>{{ '%.2f'|format(RA.vol_target_scalar) }}×</b></div>{% endif %}
        {% if RA.get('news_sentiment') is not none %}
        {% set _nscol = 'var(--up)' if RA.news_sentiment_state=='optimistic' else 'var(--down)' %}
        <div class="kv">{{ t('News sentiment', '新闻情绪') }}
          {{ help("The San Francisco Fed's Daily News Sentiment Index — economic tone extracted from major US newspapers (history from 1980). A continuous, reproducible read of the macro mood (positive = optimistic), and a quant complement to the AI news digests.", "旧金山联储每日新闻情绪指数 — 从美国主流报纸提取的经济基调（自 1980 年）。对宏观情绪的连续、可复现读数（正值＝乐观），是 AI 新闻摘要的量化补充。") }}
          <b style="color:{{ _nscol }}">{{ '%+.2f'|format(RA.news_sentiment) }}</b> <span class="muted sm">{{ t(RA.news_sentiment_state, {'optimistic':'乐观','pessimistic':'悲观'}.get(RA.news_sentiment_state, RA.news_sentiment_state)) }}</span></div>{% endif %}
        {% if CAP and CAP.active %}
        {% set _firing = CAP.signals_firing or [] %}
        {% set _cot_on = (CAP.score or 0) - (_firing|length) %}
        {% set _vrp_on = 'VRP extreme' in _firing %}
        {% set _vix_on = 'VIX panic' in _firing %}
        <div class="kv" style="margin-top:6px;padding-top:6px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)">{{ t('Capitulation', '恐慌触底') }}
          <span class="help">?<span class="tip">
            <span class="l-en"><b>Capitulation gauge</b> — a CONTRARIAN bounce setup. It counts how many of three "everyone has panicked" signals are firing right now:</span>
            <span class="l-zh"><b>恐慌触底指标</b> — 逆向反弹布局。统计三个"人人恐慌"信号当前有几个触发：</span>
            <table class="sigtab">
              <tr><td><b>Vol-risk-premium extreme</b><br><span class="muted" style="font-size:10px"><span class="l-en">fear over-priced vs actual moves</span><span class="l-zh">恐惧相对实际波动被高估</span></span></td><td class="{{ 'sig-on' if _vrp_on else 'sig-off' }}">{{ '✓ firing' if _vrp_on else '– quiet' }}</td></tr>
              <tr><td><b>VIX &gt; 30</b><br><span class="muted" style="font-size:10px"><span class="l-en">outright panic in options</span><span class="l-zh">期权市场全面恐慌</span></span></td><td class="{{ 'sig-on' if _vix_on else 'sig-off' }}">{{ '✓ firing' if _vix_on else '– quiet' }}</td></tr>
              <tr><td><b>COT washout</b><br><span class="muted" style="font-size:10px"><span class="l-en">speculators dumped their longs</span><span class="l-zh">投机者抛空多头</span></span></td><td class="{{ 'sig-on' if _cot_on >= 1 else 'sig-off' }}">{{ '✓ firing' if _cot_on >= 1 else '– quiet' }}</td></tr>
            </table>
            <span class="l-en">MEASURED: when ≥2 stack, the S&P returned <b>+9.3%</b> over the next 3 months (<b>86%</b> positive) with shallower drawdowns — vs +2.8% base. It marks fear, not a forecast, and is silent in calm markets.</span>
            <span class="l-zh">实测：当 ≥2 个叠加时，标普未来三月 <b>+9.3%</b>（<b>86%</b> 为正），回撤更浅 — 基准 +2.8%。它标记恐惧而非预测，平静市场中静默。</span>
          </span></span>
          <b style="float:right;color:var(--up)">{{ CAP.score }}/3 {% if CAP.strong %}⚑{% endif %}</b></div>
        <div class="muted sm">{{ t('Historically a bounce setup:', '历史上的反弹布局：') }} <b style="color:var(--up)">+{{ CAP.measured_bounce_pct }}%/3mo</b>, {{ CAP.measured_hit_pct }}% {{ t('positive (vs +2.8% base)', '为正（基准 +2.8%）') }}</div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <!-- What's driving markets — daily cross-asset driver attribution (DISPLAY-ONLY) -->
      {% if latest.market_drivers and latest.market_drivers.verdict not in [none, 'unknown'] %}
      {% set MD = latest.market_drivers %}
      <div class="span12" style="background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px">
        <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px">{{ t("What's driving markets", '市场驱动因素') }}
          <span class="muted sm">{{ t('past week', '过去一周') }}</span>
          {{ help("Which single cross-asset FORCE has moved the tape over the last week — Fed repricing, real-rate shock, USD, credit stress, a liquidity impulse, China, oil, AI/semis or crypto. Each driver is a fingerprint of cross-asset legs; this names the strongest by scoring how coherently each fingerprint is lit — every leg's 5-day move z-scored against its own year of history, so a 2σ move in real yields is comparable to a 2σ move in HY spreads. 'Mixed' = no single driver clearly leads the runner-up; 'quiet' = nothing is moving beyond its normal weekly range. DISPLAY-ONLY: a regime read, it never scores or sizes anything.", "过去一周哪一种跨资产力量在主导行情 — 美联储重定价、实际利率冲击、美元、信用压力、流动性脉冲、中国、油价、AI/半导体或加密。每个驱动是一组跨资产腿的指纹；此处通过衡量每个指纹被点亮的一致程度来指出最强者 — 每条腿的 5 日变动相对其自身一年历史做 z 标准化，使实际利率的 2σ 变动与高收益利差的 2σ 变动可比。'混合'＝没有单一驱动明显领先次强者；'平静'＝波动未超出正常周度区间。仅供显示：这是周期读数，绝不评分或决定仓位。") }}
          {% set _vcol = 'var(--text)' if MD.verdict=='clear' else 'var(--muted)' %}
          <span class="badge" style="float:right;font-size:11px;color:{{ _vcol }}">{{ t(MD.verdict, MD.verdict_zh) }}{% if MD.confidence %} · {{ t('confidence', '置信度') }} {{ t(MD.confidence, MD.confidence_zh) }}{% endif %}</span>
        </div>
        {% if MD.verdict == 'quiet' %}
        <div class="muted">{{ t('No dominant driver — cross-asset moves are within their normal weekly range.', '无主导驱动 — 跨资产波动处于正常的周度区间内。') }}</div>
        {% else %}
        <div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:2px">{{ t(MD.primary_label, MD.primary_label_zh) }}
          <span class="muted" style="font-weight:400">— {{ t(MD.direction, MD.direction_zh) }}</span></div>
        {% if MD.verdict == 'mixed' and MD.runner_up_label %}
        <div class="muted sm" style="margin-bottom:4px">{{ t('jointly with', '与之并列') }} {{ t(MD.runner_up_label, MD.runner_up_label_zh) }} {{ t('— no single dominant driver', '— 无单一主导驱动') }}</div>
        {% endif %}
        {% if MD.evidence_legs %}
        <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin:6px 0">
          {% for e in MD.evidence_legs %}
          <span class="badge" style="font-size:11px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel)">{{ t(e.en, e.zh) }} {{ '%+.1f'|format(e.z) }}σ</span>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="muted sm">{{ t('Invalidation', '失效条件') }}: {{ t(MD.invalidation, MD.invalidation_zh) }}</div>
        {% endif %}
        <!-- all-driver strength bars (neutral on purpose — a decomposition, not a buy/sell on any leg) -->
        <div style="margin-top:8px;padding-top:8px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)">
          {% for s in MD.scores %}
          {% set _isp = (s.driver == MD.primary and MD.verdict != 'quiet') %}
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:2px 0;{% if _isp %}font-weight:700{% endif %}">
            <div style="flex:0 0 150px;font-size:12px">{{ t(s.label, s.label_zh) }}</div>
            <div style="flex:1;background:var(--panel);border-radius:3px;height:8px;overflow:hidden">
              <div style="width:{{ (([s.strength, 3]|min)/3*100)|round|int }}%;height:8px;background:var(--{{ 'text' if _isp else 'muted' }});opacity:{{ 0.65 if _isp else 0.4 }}"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="muted sm" style="flex:0 0 44px;text-align:right">{{ '%+.2f'|format(s.projection) }}</div>
          </div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      <!-- factor leadership (cross-sectional equity factors) -->
      {% if factor_leadership %}
      <div class="span12" style="background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px">
        <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px">{{ t('Equity factor leadership', '股票因子领先') }}
          <span class="help">?<span class="tip">
            <span class="l-en"><b>Which "style" of stock is winning</b> over the last 63 days. Each badge below is one factor's top-fifth-minus-bottom-fifth return across the S&P 1500 (from SEC fundamentals):</span>
            <span class="l-zh"><b>哪种"风格"的股票在领先</b>（近 63 日）。下方每个标签是该因子在标普 1500 中顶部五分位减底部五分位的回报（源自 SEC 基本面）：</span>
            <table class="sigtab">
              <tr><td><b>Value</b></td><td class="l"><span class="l-en">cheap vs fundamentals</span><span class="l-zh">相对基本面便宜</span></td></tr>
              <tr><td><b>Quality</b></td><td class="l"><span class="l-en">strong balance sheets</span><span class="l-zh">资产负债表稳健</span></td></tr>
              <tr><td><b>Profitability</b></td><td class="l"><span class="l-en">high margins / ROE</span><span class="l-zh">高利润率／ROE</span></td></tr>
              <tr><td><b>Low-vol</b></td><td class="l"><span class="l-en">steady, defensive names</span><span class="l-zh">稳健的防御股</span></td></tr>
            </table>
            <span class="lad" style="background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--up) 16%,var(--panel))"><span class="l-en"><b>Quality/profitability leading</b> → risk-on, growth-led tape</span><span class="l-zh"><b>质量／盈利领先</b> → 风险偏好、成长主导</span></span>
            <span class="lad" style="background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--orange) 16%,var(--panel))"><span class="l-en"><b>Value/low-vol leading</b> → defensive, late-cycle</span><span class="l-zh"><b>价值／低波动领先</b> → 防御、周期晚段</span></span>
          </span></span>
          <a href="factors.html" class="muted sm" style="float:right">{{ t('Factors page →', '因子页 →') }}</a></div>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:4px">
          {% for L in factor_leadership %}
          <span class="badge" style="font-size:11px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel);color:{{ 'var(--up)' if L.spread_pct>=0 else 'var(--down)' }}">{{ td(L.label) }} {{ '%+.1f'|format(L.spread_pct) }}%</span>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
        {% if ST and ST.tilt %}
        {% set _yup = ST.yield_chg_1m_bp is not none and ST.yield_chg_1m_bp > 0 %}
        <div class="muted sm" style="margin-top:7px;padding-top:6px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)">{{ t('Value vs Growth style tilt:', '价值对成长风格倾向：') }}
          <b style="color:{{ 'var(--up)' if ST.tilt=='value' else ('var(--down)' if ST.tilt=='growth' else 'var(--muted)') }}">{{ t(ST.tilt, {'value':'价值','growth':'成长','neutral':'中性'}.get(ST.tilt, ST.tilt)) }}</b>
          ({{ t('10y', '十年期') }} {{ '%+.0f'|format(ST.yield_chg_1m_bp) if ST.yield_chg_1m_bp is not none else '—' }}bp/mo)
          <span class="help">?<span class="tip">
            <span class="l-en">The 10-year Treasury yield quietly steers which style leads. The relationship is one of the most reliable we measured:</span>
            <span class="l-zh">十年期国债收益率悄然主导哪种风格领先。这是我们测得最可靠的关系之一：</span>
            <table class="sigtab">
              <tr><td><b>10y rising ▲</b></td><td class="l" style="color:var(--up)"><span class="l-en">→ VALUE leads</span><span class="l-zh">→ 价值领先</span></td></tr>
              <tr><td><b>10y falling ▼</b></td><td class="l" style="color:var(--down)"><span class="l-en">→ GROWTH leads</span><span class="l-zh">→ 成长领先</span></td></tr>
            </table>
            <span class="muted" style="font-size:10.5px;display:block">{{ t('Now:', '现在：') }} {{ t('10y', '十年期') }} {{ '%+.0f'|format(ST.yield_chg_1m_bp) if ST.yield_chg_1m_bp is not none else '—' }}bp/mo {% if _yup %}▲{% elif ST.yield_chg_1m_bp is not none and ST.yield_chg_1m_bp < 0 %}▼{% endif %}</span>
            <span class="l-en" style="display:block;margin-top:4px">MEASURED: value beat growth +0.8%/63d when the 10y rose &gt;10bp/month (t=+3.0), in all four 2000–2026 sub-periods. A tilt, not a trade signal.</span>
            <span class="l-zh" style="display:block;margin-top:4px">实测：当十年期月内上行 &gt;10bp 时，价值股 63 天内跑赢成长股 +0.8%（t=+3.0），且在 2000–2026 四个子周期中均成立。这是倾向，而非交易信号。</span>
          </span></span></div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      <!-- scenario odds (quad x financial-conditions direction) -->
      {% if SC and SC.current %}
      <div class="span12" style="background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px">
        {% set _hit = SC.current.hit_pct|round|int %}
        <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px">{{ t('What happens next — scenario odds', '接下来会怎样 — 情景概率') }}
          <span class="help">?<span class="tip">
            <span class="l-en">History rhymes. We look back at every month that matched <b>today's setup</b> — the regime's risk group AND whether financial conditions were loosening or tightening — and count how often the S&P rose the next month.</span>
            <span class="l-zh">历史会重演。我们回看所有与<b>今日格局</b>相符的月份 — 周期的风险组别，以及金融条件当时在宽松还是收紧 — 统计标普次月上涨的频率。</span>
            <span class="l-en" style="display:block;margin-top:5px">Adding the conditions-direction split moved the hit rate 13–20pp and held in both halves of 2007–2026. These are <b>base rates from history, not a forecast</b>.</span>
            <span class="l-zh" style="display:block;margin-top:5px">加入条件方向后，胜率变动 13–20 个百分点，并在 2007–2026 两个样本半区均成立。这些是<b>历史基础概率，而非预测</b>。</span>
          </span></span></div>
        <div class="muted sm" style="margin-bottom:6px">{{ t("Today's setup:", '今日格局：') }} <b>{{ td(SC.group) }}</b> · {{ t('conditions', '条件') }} <b>{{ t(SC.direction, {'loosening':'宽松中','tightening':'收紧中'}.get(SC.direction, SC.direction)) }}</b></div>
        <div class="oddsbar" title="{{ _hit }}% / {{ 100-_hit }}%">
          <div class="ob-hit" style="width:{{ _hit }}%">{% if _hit >= 18 %}{{ _hit }}% ↑{% endif %}</div>
          <div class="ob-miss" style="width:{{ 100-_hit }}%">{% if (100-_hit) >= 18 %}{{ 100-_hit }}% ↓{% endif %}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="muted sm">{{ t('S&P higher one month later', '标普一个月后走高') }} <b style="color:var(--up)">{{ _hit }}%</b> {{ t('of the time', '的概率') }}
          <span class="muted">({{ '%+.2f'|format(SC.current.avg_pct) }}% {{ t('avg', '平均') }}, n={{ SC.current.n }})</span>
          {% if SC.contrast %}
          <div class="ocmp"><span>{{ t('vs', '对比') }}</span><span class="oc-alt">{{ SC.contrast.hit_pct|round|int }}%</span><span>{{ t('when conditions are', '当条件为') }} {{ t(SC.contrast_direction, {'loosening':'宽松','tightening':'收紧'}.get(SC.contrast_direction, SC.contrast_direction)) }}</span></div>{% endif %}</div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}

    </div>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ======================= MACRO NEWS, SENTIMENT & CATALYSTS ======================= -->
  <style>
  #macro-news .mn-cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.7fr 1fr;gap:20px;margin-top:10px}
  #macro-news .section-title{font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 8px;font-weight:700}
  #macro-news .mn-sent{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;font-size:14px;margin:2px 0 4px}
  #macro-news .mn-brief{background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;margin:8px 0 4px}
  #macro-news .mn-item{display:block;padding:6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--panel2);color:var(--text);text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4}
  #macro-news .mn-item:hover{color:var(--up)}
  #macro-news .mn-theme,#macro-news .cat-type{display:inline-block;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.03em;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:5px;background:var(--line);color:var(--muted)}
  #macro-news .mn-theme{margin-right:7px;vertical-align:1px}
  #macro-news .mn-t-monetary{background:#22324f;color:#9cc4ff}#macro-news .mn-t-inflation{background:#4f2c22;color:#ffb499}
  #macro-news .mn-t-labor{background:#1f4733;color:#a0ffc4}#macro-news .mn-t-growth{background:#2c3f1f;color:#cfe89a}
  #macro-news .mn-t-credit{background:#3a2f5f;color:#c4b0ff}#macro-news .mn-t-fiscal{background:#4f3a1f;color:#ffd79a}
  #macro-news .mn-t-macro{background:#2a3340;color:#a9c0d6}
  #macro-news .cat-row{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:baseline;padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--panel2);font-size:13px}
  #macro-news .cat-date{color:var(--muted);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;min-width:118px}
  #macro-news .cat-imp{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;flex:0 0 auto;align-self:center;background:var(--muted)}
  #macro-news .imp-high{background:var(--warn)} #macro-news .imp-med{background:var(--muted)}
  #macro-news .ct-FOMC{background:#3a2f5f;color:#c4b0ff}#macro-news .ct-NFP,#macro-news .ct-CLAIMS{background:#1f4733;color:#a0ffc4}
  #macro-news .ct-CPI,#macro-news .ct-PPI{background:#4f2c22;color:#ffb499}#macro-news .ct-PCE{background:#4f3a1f;color:#ffd79a}
  #macro-news .ct-GDP,#macro-news .ct-ISM_MFG,#macro-news .ct-ISM_SVC{background:#2c3f1f;color:#cfe89a}
  #macro-news .ct-OPEX{background:#22324f;color:#9cc4ff}#macro-news .ct-AUCTION{background:#33305a;color:#b9b0ff}
  /* compact "US high-impact next 14 days" glance strip (display/context only) */
  #macro-news .ev-strip{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:8px 0 4px;padding:9px 11px;background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px}
  #macro-news .ev-strip-h{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--muted);margin-right:2px}
  #macro-news .ev-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:baseline;gap:5px;font-size:12px;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:6px;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);white-space:nowrap}
  #macro-news .ev-chip b{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.02em}
  #macro-news .ev-chip .ev-when{color:var(--muted);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
  #macro-news .ev-chip.ec-FOMC{border-color:#5a4a8f}#macro-news .ev-chip.ec-FOMC b{color:#c4b0ff}
  #macro-news .ev-chip.ec-CPI b,#macro-news .ev-chip.ec-PPI b{color:#ffb499}
  #macro-news .ev-chip.ec-NFP b,#macro-news .ev-chip.ec-CLAIMS b{color:#a0ffc4}
  #macro-news .ev-chip.ec-GDP b{color:#cfe89a}#macro-news .ev-chip.ec-PCE b{color:#ffd79a}
  #macro-news .ev-strip-none{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
  #macro-news .mn-disc{color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:8px;line-height:1.5}
  @media(max-width:760px){ #macro-news .mn-cols{grid-template-columns:1fr} }
  </style>
  <div class="panel span12" id="macro-news">
    <h2>📰 {{ t('Macro news, sentiment &amp; catalysts', '宏观新闻、情绪与日程') }}
      {{ help("Filtered macro news (reputable sources, macro themes only — each headline tagged by theme), the SF-Fed Daily News Sentiment Index (a quantitative series, NOT per-headline AI), and a unified US event calendar (FOMC, CPI/PPI, jobs report, GDP, PCE, jobless claims, ISM, options-expiry and Treasury auctions). All CONTEXT — none of it feeds any score, signal or allocation, and the mechanical model never sees it. There is deliberately NO event-risk dampener: pre-FOMC drift died after 2016 and the announcement premium is positive, so cutting exposure into prints would be wrong-signed. Dates are scheduling info, not forecasts.", "已筛选的宏观新闻（仅可靠来源、仅宏观主题，每条按主题标注）、旧金山联储每日新闻情绪指数（量化序列，而非逐条新闻 AI），以及统一的美国事件日历（FOMC、CPI/PPI、就业报告、GDP、PCE、初请失业金、ISM、期权到期与国债拍卖）。全部为背景 —— 不进入任何评分、信号或配置，机械模型也从不读取。我们刻意不做事件风险衰减：2016 年后 FOMC 前漂移已消失、公告溢价为正，因此在数据公布前削减仓位方向是错的。日期为日程信息，而非预测。") }}
    </h2>
    {# compact US high-impact catalyst strip (next 14 days) — glanceable scheduling
       context. DISPLAY ONLY: it never feeds a score, signal or allocation. #}
    <div class="ev-strip">
      <span class="ev-strip-h">{{ t('US high-impact · next 14 days', '美国高影响 · 未来14天') }}</span>
      {% for s in event_strip %}
      <span class="ev-chip ec-{{ s.type }}" title="{{ s.label }}{% if s.time_et %} · {{ s.time_et }} ET{% endif %}"><b>{{ s.type }}</b> <span class="ev-when">{{ s.dow }} {{ s.md }}</span></span>
      {% else %}
