            {% if n.alpha_z is not none %}<span class="nb-az {{ 'az-up' if n.alpha_z > 0 else ('az-dn' if n.alpha_z < 0 else '') }}" title="Sector-neutral residual momentum (z) — stock-specific strength with market + sector beta stripped. A ranking/context leg, not a standalone signal. · 行业中性残差动量（z）— 剥离大盘与行业 beta 后的个股特定强度。属排序/情境维度，并非独立信号。">α {{ '%+.2f'|format(n.alpha_z) }}</span>{% endif %}
            {% if n.alpha_sector_rank %}<span class="nb-rk" title="Rank within its GICS sector by sector-neutral momentum · 按行业中性动量在其 GICS 行业内的排名">#{{ n.alpha_sector_rank }}/{{ n.alpha_sector_n }}</span>{% endif %}
            {% if n.alpha_entry == 'pullback' %}<span class="nb-ent ent-good" title="A leader on a recent pullback — a more constructive entry · 强势股近期回调 — 更具建设性的入场点">{{ t('pullback', '回调') }}</span>
            {% elif n.alpha_entry == 'extended' %}<span class="nb-ent ent-warn" title="A leader that just spiked — short-term reversal risk · 强势股刚刚拉升 — 短线反转风险">{{ t('extended', '过热') }}</span>{% endif %}
            {% if n.insider_buyers %}<span class="nb-ins" title="{{ n.insider_buyers }} distinct insiders net-bought{% if n.insider_net_mn %} ${{ '%.1f'|format(n.insider_net_mn) }}M{% endif %}{% if n.insider_bps %} (+{{ n.insider_bps }} bps of cap){% endif %} in the last 6 months — a Form-4 CLUSTER confirmer (orthogonal long-only conviction, not a standalone signal) · {{ n.insider_buyers }} 名内部人近 6 个月净买入 — Form-4 集群确认指标">👤 {{ n.insider_buyers }}</span>{% endif %}
            {% if n.sue_z %}<span class="nb-sue" title="Earnings momentum: SUE z {{ '%+.1f'|format(n.sue_z) }} vs the S&P 1500 — the latest quarter beat its year-ago seasonal expectation and tends to keep drifting (post-earnings-announcement drift). The only positive factor leg to survive the leak-free FDR scorecard; a DISPLAY confirmer, never part of the setup score · 盈利动量：SUE z {{ '%+.1f'|format(n.sue_z) }}（相对标普1500）— 最新季度超出去年同期季节性预期并倾向延续漂移（盈利后漂移）。唯一通过无泄漏FDR检验的正向因子；仅为展示确认项，不计入布局分">📈 SUE {{ '%+.1f'|format(n.sue_z) }}</span>{% endif %}
          </div>
          {% endif %}
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
      {% endif %}
      </div>
      {% if top_setups and top_setups.buy %}
      <div class="topsetups">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap">
          <span style="font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px">⚡ {{ t('Top setups', '顶级布局') }}</span>
          <span class="muted" style="font-size:11px">{{ t('sector-neutral momentum (α) leaders · cycle entry & insiders shown as context · across the S&P 1500', '行业中性动量（α）领涨股 · 周期入场与内部人作为情境 · 覆盖标普 1500') }}
            {{ help("Alpha leaders (sector-neutral residual momentum — market + sector beta stripped) ranked across the WHOLE S&P 1500, so it can surface a high-conviction small/mid-cap name that isn't in any sector ETF's top-10. RANKED BY α: we Phase-0 tested blending the cycle entry + reversal overlay into the rank (reports/setup-score-phase0.md, survivorship-clean S&P 500, 12y, PIT) and the blend did NOT improve forward-return ranking — it diluted α — so the board rides the validated α leg. The cycle state + pullback/extended + the 'setup' column are shown as risk-placement CONTEXT (when to enter), not a return signal, and the 👤 chip flags an insider buy-cluster confirmer. Click any row for the full breakdown.", "行业中性残差动量（剥离大盘与行业 beta）的领涨股，在整个标普 1500 范围内排序，因此能发掘并不在任何行业 ETF 前十大持仓中的高置信中小盘个股。按 α 排序：我们做了 Phase-0 检验，把周期入场+反转叠加混入排序（reports/setup-score-phase0.md，无幸存者偏差的标普500，12年，PIT），该混合并未改善前瞻收益排序 — 反而稀释了 α — 因此榜单以已验证的 α 为准。周期状态、回调/过热以及“布局分”列作为风险摆位的情境展示（何时入场），而非收益信号；👤 标记表示内部人集群买入的确认指标。点击任意行查看完整拆解。") }}</span>
          <a class="ts-more" href="discovery.html">{{ t('Top Picks', '精选股') }} →</a>
        </div>
        <table class="ts-tbl">
