            <th>{{ t('cycle', '周期') }}</th><th>{{ t('entry', '入场') }}</th>
            <th class="r" title="Cross-sectional factor composite (value / quality / low-vol …) — a LIGHT quality tiebreaker (crowded, post-publication decayed), not a driver · 横截面因子综合（价值/质量/低波…）— 轻量质量打破平局，非主导">{{ t('factor', '因子') }}</th>
            <th class="r" title="Entry-context blend (0.7·alpha-z + cycle/reversal timing). The board is ranked by α, not this — Phase-0 found the blend does not improve forward-return ranking (reports/setup-score-phase0.md). · 入场情境混合分（0.7·alpha-z + 周期/反转择时）。榜单按 α 排序而非此分 — Phase-0 显示该混合不改善前瞻收益排序。">{{ t('setup', '布局分') }}</th>
          </tr></thead>
          <tbody>
          {% for r in top_setups.buy[:10] %}
            <tr class="ts-row" onclick="location.href='stock.html#{{ r.ticker }}'">
              <td><span class="ts-tk">{{ r.ticker }}</span> <span class="ts-nm">{{ r.name }}</span>{% if r.insider_buyers %} <span class="ts-ins" title="{{ r.insider_buyers }} distinct insiders net-bought{% if r.insider_net_mn %} ${{ '%.1f'|format(r.insider_net_mn) }}M{% endif %}{% if r.insider_bps %} (+{{ r.insider_bps }} bps of cap){% endif %} in the last 6 months — a Form-4 CLUSTER confirmer · {{ r.insider_buyers }} 名内部人近 6 个月净买入 — Form-4 集群确认">👤 {{ r.insider_buyers }}</span>{% endif %}{% if r.sue_z %} <span class="ts-sue" title="Earnings momentum: SUE z {{ '%+.1f'|format(r.sue_z) }} vs the S&P 1500 — the latest quarter beat its year-ago seasonal expectation and tends to keep drifting (post-earnings-announcement drift). The only positive factor leg to survive the leak-free FDR scorecard; a DISPLAY confirmer, never part of the setup score · 盈利动量：SUE z {{ '%+.1f'|format(r.sue_z) }}（相对标普1500）— 唯一通过无泄漏FDR检验的正向因子；仅为展示确认项，不计入布局分">📈 SUE {{ '%+.1f'|format(r.sue_z) }}</span>{% endif %}</td>
              <td class="muted">{{ td(r.sector) }}</td>
              <td class="r {{ 'az-up' if r.alpha and r.alpha > 0 else 'az-dn' }}">{{ '%+.2f'|format(r.alpha) }}</td>
              <td class="r muted">{% if r.sector_rank %}#{{ r.sector_rank }}/{{ r.sector_n }}{% endif %}</td>
              <td>{% if r.label %}{{ td(r.label) }}{% else %}<span class="muted">—</span>{% endif %}</td>
              <td>{% if r.alpha_entry == 'pullback' %}<span class="ent-good">{{ t('pullback', '回调') }}</span>{% elif r.alpha_entry == 'extended' %}<span class="ent-warn">{{ t('extended', '过热') }}</span>{% else %}<span class="muted">{{ r.alpha_entry or '—' }}</span>{% endif %}</td>
              <td class="r {{ 'az-up' if r.factor_z and r.factor_z > 0 else ('az-dn' if r.factor_z and r.factor_z < 0 else 'muted') }}">{% if r.factor_z is not none %}{{ '%+.1f'|format(r.factor_z) }}{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>
              <td class="r"><b>{{ '%+.2f'|format(r.setup) }}</b></td>
            </tr>
          {% endfor %}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    <p class="muted" style="font-size:11.5px; margin-top:8px">⚠ {{ t("Cycle-timing signals are about <i>where in the price cycle</i> a sector is — most useful combined with the regime read above. Our calibration shows these states don't beat buy-and-hold on average return; their value is structure and risk placement (entry + a defined exit), not certainty.", "周期择时信号关乎一个板块<i>处于价格周期的哪个位置</i> — 与上方的周期判读结合使用最有价值。我们的校准显示这些状态在平均回报上并不能跑赢买入持有；它们的价值在于结构与风险摆位（入场 + 明确的出场），而非确定性。") }}</p>
  </div>
