    <h2>{{ t('Sector Bottom Radar — washout durability, not rotation', '板块见底雷达 — 错杀的持久性，而非轮动') }}
      {{ help("The buy-side complement to the heat board below. It runs the SAME validated 'Bottom Confidence' score we compute per stock (walk-forward calibrated monotone on 69k evals) on each sector ETF: how DURABLE a washing-out sector's low looks — high = the kind of selloff whose low has historically held with a SHALLOWER drawdown — discounted when the turn isn't confirmed on the weekly/monthly and when price is a deep falling-knife below its 200-day. The whole board is then conditioned by the index Fed-put gate: in a put-absent regime (recession or inflation-locked Fed) the same washout signals kept falling in 2000/2008/2022. This is a RISK / DURABILITY read, NOT a return forecast and NOT alpha — it trades some of the explosive bounce for a much higher chance the low holds. The heat board describes what's already hot (and late); this finds where a durable low may be forming. Validated in research/SECTOR_BOTTOM_RADAR.md.", "下方热度榜的买方补充。它在每个板块 ETF 上运行与个股相同的、经验证的「见底信心」分数（经 6.9 万次步进式校准、单调有效）：衡量一个正被错杀的板块其低点有多持久——分数越高，代表这类抛售的低点历史上更易守住、回撤更浅——当周线／月线尚未确认转向、或价格深跌破 200 日线（接飞刀）时会打折。整个看板再由指数层面的美联储托底闸门来条件化：在托底缺位（衰退或通胀锁死）的格局下，同类超卖信号在 2000／2008／2022 年持续下跌。这是风险／持久性读数，并非收益预测、也非超额收益——它以让出部分爆发式反弹，换取低点守住的更高概率。热度榜描述的是已经火热（且偏晚）的板块；本雷达则寻找可能正在形成的持久低点。验证见 research/SECTOR_BOTTOM_RADAR.md。") }}
    </h2>
    <p class="{{ 'neg' if sector_radar.put_absent else 'pos' }}" style="margin:0 2px 12px; font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.5">
      <b>{{ t('Macro gate', '宏观闸门') }}:</b> {{ sector_radar.macro_banner }}
    </p>
    <table>
      <tr>
        <th class="l">{{ t('sector', '板块') }}</th>
        <th class="l" style="min-width:150px">{{ t('bottom confidence', '见底信心') }} <span class="help">?<span class="tip">
          <span class="l-en"><b>Bottom Confidence</b> 0-100 — how durable, low-drawdown this sector's low looks. <b>Measured (sector ETFs, 1998-2026):</b> sectors scoring 60+ held their cycle low ~79% of the time vs ~34% at 0-20, with a shallower drawdown tail. Higher = a more durable low, <i>not</i> a bigger bounce (the deepest washouts bounce hardest but rarely hold). Risk/durability, never a return forecast.</span>
          <span class="l-zh"><b>见底信心</b> 0-100 — 衡量该板块的低点有多持久、回撤有多浅。<b>实测（板块 ETF，1998-2026）：</b>得分 60+ 的板块约 79% 守住其周期低点，而 0-20 区间仅约 34%，且回撤尾部更浅。分数越高代表低点越持久，<i>而非</i>反弹更大（最深的错杀反弹最猛，却很少守住）。这是风险／持久性，绝非收益预测。</span>
        </span></span></th>
        <th>{{ t('verdict', '判定') }}</th>
        <th class="l">{{ t('members washed / turning', '成分股超卖／转向') }} {{ help("Live breadth confirmer: of the sector's S&P 500 members, the share below their 200-day (washed out) and, of those, the share reclaiming their 10-day (turning up). Displayed context only — the breadth cache is ~1y deep so this leg is not deep-backtested and never enters the score.", "实时宽度确认：在该板块的标普500成分股中，跌破 200 日线（超卖）的比例，以及其中已收复 10 日线（转向）的比例。仅作背景参考——宽度缓存约 1 年深度，该项未经深度回测，且不计入分数。") }}</th>
        <th class="l">{{ t('read', '解读') }}</th>
      </tr>
      {% for r in sector_radar.washed %}
      <tr>
        <td class="l"><b>{{ td(r.name) }}</b> <span class="muted" style="font-size:11px">{{ r.ticker }}</span></td>
        <td class="l" data-sort="{{ r.bc_pct }}">
          {% if r.bottom_confidence is not none %}
          <span class="help">
            <span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px">
              <span style="display:inline-block;width:60px;height:9px;background:var(--panel2);border-radius:5px;overflow:hidden"><i style="display:block;height:100%;width:{{ r.bc_pct }}%;background:{{ r.v_color }}"></i></span>
              <b>{{ r.bc_pct }}</b>
              {% if r.bc_grade_t %}<span class="muted" style="font-size:11px">{{ r.bc_grade_t }}</span>{% endif %}
            </span>
            {% if r.bc_line %}<span class="tip"><span class="l-en">{{ r.bc_line }}{% if r.bc_knife_line %}<br>{{ r.bc_knife_line }}{% endif %}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ r.bc_line_zh or r.bc_line }}{% if r.bc_knife_line_zh %}<br>{{ r.bc_knife_line_zh }}{% endif %}</span></span>{% endif %}
          </span>
          {% else %}<span class="muted">—</span>{% endif %}
        </td>
        <td><span class="pill {{ r.v_tone }}" style="border-color:{{ r.v_color }};color:{{ r.v_color }}">{{ r.v_pill }}</span></td>
        <td class="l muted" style="font-size:12px">{% if r.breadth_str %}{{ r.breadth_str }}{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>
        <td class="l muted" style="font-size:12px;max-width:340px">{{ r.label_t }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </table>
    <p class="muted" style="margin:8px 2px 0; font-size:11px">
      {{ t('Risk / durability read — confirm into stabilization, do not anticipate the exact low. Not alpha.', '风险／持久性读数 — 确认企稳后再介入，勿预判精确低点。非超额收益。') }}
      <a href="#sectors" style="margin-left:6px">{{ t('rotation context ↓', '轮动背景 ↓') }}</a>
    </p>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ======================= SECTOR HEAT BOARD ======================= -->
  <div class="panel span12" id="sectors">
    <h2>{{ t('Sector heat board — regime × tape × technicals × seasonality', '板块热度榜 — 周期 × 盘面 × 技术 × 季节性') }}
      {{ help("One row per sector, everything that matters in one place. HEAT (0-100) measures how CONFIRMED a sector's strength is right now: regime fit + rotation stage + technicals, minus crowding. Important: heat describes the present, not the future — our 2007-2026 backtest shows the hottest band (70+) actually UNDERPERFORMED over the following months (everything-confirmed usually means late). So: high heat = hold/trim territory, never a fresh-entry signal; the buy workflow is the watchlist + trigger column.", "每个板块一行，把重要的一切放在一处。热度（0–100）衡量一个板块的强势此刻有多被确认：周期契合度 + 轮动阶段 + 技术面，减去拥挤度。重要：热度描述的是现在，而非未来 — 我们 2007–2026 的回测显示最热的区间（70+）在随后几个月反而跑输（万事俱备通常意味着已晚）。因此：高热度 = 持有／减仓区，绝非新建仓信号；买入流程靠观察名单 + 触发列。") }}
    </h2>
    <table>
      <tr>
        <th class="l">{{ t('sector', '板块') }}</th>
        <th class="l" style="min-width:130px">{{ t('heat', '热度') }} <span class="help">?<span class="tip">
          <span class="l-en">
          <b>Heat</b> = how CONFIRMED a sector's strength is (regime fit + trend stage +
          technicals − crowding − a macro-risk adjustment when macro risk is elevated and
          the sector is macro-sensitive). Hover each bar for its exact arithmetic.
          <table>
            <tr><th>band</th><th>read it as</th><th>measured 3-month record*</th></tr>
            <tr><td style="color:var(--orange)"><b>70+ OVERHEATED</b></td><td>late — hold/trim, don't start</td><td>beat market 47% (−0.6% avg)</td></tr>
            <tr><td style="color:var(--up)"><b>55-69 HOT</b></td><td>confirmed — hold, buy pullbacks</td><td>49% (−0.3%)</td></tr>
            <tr><td><b>40-54 NEUTRAL</b></td><td>mixed, no lean</td><td>49% (−0.1%)</td></tr>
            <tr><td style="color:var(--info)"><b>0-39 COLD</b></td><td>washed out — wait for trigger</td><td>50% (+0.2%)</td></tr>
          </table>
          *vs the index, every week 2007-2026. Note the inversion: hot sectors were
          usually LATE. That measured record is the trust level — and it argues
          against chasing.
          </span>
          <span class="l-zh">
          <b>热度</b> = 一个板块的强势有多被确认（周期契合度 + 趋势阶段 +
          技术面 − 拥挤度 − 宏观风险升高且板块对宏观敏感时的宏观风险调整）。
          将鼠标悬停在每个条上可查看其精确算式。
          <table>
            <tr><th>区间</th><th>解读为</th><th>实测 3 个月记录*</th></tr>
            <tr><td style="color:var(--orange)"><b>70+ 过热</b></td><td>已晚 — 持有／减仓，勿入场</td><td>跑赢市场 47%（平均 −0.6%）</td></tr>
            <tr><td style="color:var(--up)"><b>55-69 偏热</b></td><td>已确认 — 持有，回调时买入</td><td>49%（−0.3%）</td></tr>
            <tr><td><b>40-54 中性</b></td><td>混合，无倾向</td><td>49%（−0.1%）</td></tr>
            <tr><td style="color:var(--info)"><b>0-39 偏冷</b></td><td>已洗盘 — 等待触发</td><td>50%（+0.2%）</td></tr>
          </table>
          *对比指数，2007–2026 每一周。注意这种反转：偏热的板块通常都已晚。
          这份实测记录就是可信度 — 它反对追高。
          </span>
        </span></span></th>
        <th>{{ t('stage', '阶段') }} <span class="help">?<span class="tip">
          <span class="l-en">
          <b>The rotation cycle</b> — every sector travels this loop vs the market:
          <span class="lad lad-tint" style="--c:var(--info)">1. IMPROVING — momentum turns up, trend not yet confirmed. <b>Too early</b>: buying here lost money historically.</span>
          <span class="lad lad-tint" style="--c:var(--up)">2. LEADING — confirmed uptrend. The healthy zone.</span>
          <span class="lad lad-tint" style="--c:var(--warn)">3. WEAKENING — still above trend but losing steam. Tighten stops.</span>
          <span class="lad lad-tint" style="--c:var(--down)">4. LAGGING — downtrend. Avoid until it improves again.</span>
          </span>
          <span class="l-zh">
          <b>轮动周期</b> — 每个板块相对市场都会走完这个循环：
          <span class="lad lad-tint" style="--c:var(--info)">1. 改善 — 动量转上，趋势尚未确认。<b>过早</b>：历史上在这里买入会亏钱。</span>
          <span class="lad lad-tint" style="--c:var(--up)">2. 领先 — 已确认上涨趋势。健康区。</span>
          <span class="lad lad-tint" style="--c:var(--warn)">3. 走弱 — 仍在趋势上方但动能减弱。收紧止损。</span>
          <span class="lad lad-tint" style="--c:var(--down)">4. 落后 — 下跌趋势。回避，直到再度改善。</span>
          </span>
        </span></span></th>
        <th>{{ t('3mo vs market', '3 月对比市场') }} {{ help("How much it beat or trailed the S&P 500 over the past 60 trading days — the medium-term relative trend the playbook keys off.", "过去 60 个交易日内它跑赢或落后标普 500 多少 — 剧本所依据的中期相对趋势。") }}</th>
        <th>{{ t('technicals', '技术面') }} <span class="help">?<span class="tip">
          <span class="l-en">
          <b>RSI(14)</b> — a 0-100 momentum thermometer:
          <span class="scale">
            <span style="background:var(--g-cold)">OVERSOLD</span>
            <span style="background:var(--muted)">SOFT</span>
            <span style="background:var(--up)">HEALTHY</span>
            <span style="background:var(--down)">HOT</span>
          </span>
          <span class="sl"><span>0</span><span>30</span><span>45</span><span>70</span><span>100</span></span>
          <b>✓/✗ 200d and 50d</b>: whether price is above its 200-day (long-term) and
          50-day (medium-term) average — the most basic "is it in an uptrend" filters.
          Green row = both ✓.
          </span>
          <span class="l-zh">
          <b>RSI(14)</b> — 一个 0–100 的动量温度计：
          <span class="scale">
            <span style="background:var(--g-cold)">超卖</span>
            <span style="background:var(--muted)">疲软</span>
            <span style="background:var(--up)">健康</span>
            <span style="background:var(--down)">过热</span>
          </span>
          <span class="sl"><span>0</span><span>30</span><span>45</span><span>70</span><span>100</span></span>
          <b>✓/✗ 200日 与 50日</b>：价格是否高于其 200 日（长期）与
          50 日（中期）均线 — 最基本的"是否处于上涨趋势"过滤器。
          绿色行 = 两者皆 ✓。
          </span>
        </span></span></th>
        <th>{{ t('seasonality', '季节性') }} {{ help("This sector's average return in the current calendar month (and how often that month closed up). Hover any value for the full 12-month picture — a chart plus a table, with this month highlighted. Weak evidence by nature: background context only, never a signal on its own, and deliberately left out of the heat score.", "该板块在当前日历月的平均回报（以及该月收涨的频率）。将鼠标悬停在任意数值上可查看完整的 12 个月全貌 — 图表加表格，并高亮当前月份。本质上是弱证据：仅作背景参考，绝不单独作为信号，并已刻意排除在热度分数之外。") }}</th>
        <th>{{ t('to trigger', '距触发') }} {{ help("For sectors below their long-term relative trend: how much more outperformance vs SPY is needed for the trend to cross (= the data-backed buy confirmation), and how far along it already is from its recent low. Small gap + high progress = watch closely.", "对于低于其长期相对趋势的板块：还需相对 SPY 多跑赢多少趋势才会交叉（= 有数据支撑的买入确认），以及从近期低点起已走了多远。差距小 + 进度高 = 密切观察。") }}</th>
        <th>{{ t('cycle timing', '周期择时') }} {{ help("From the sector's own price cycle (click the sector name for the full drill-down): where it sits in its ~36-42 trading-day cycle and how many of its top-10 holdings are in a buy setup (BOTTOMING or BUY ZONE). The per-state historical base rates live on the drill-down page.", "来自板块自身的价格周期（点击板块名称查看完整下钻）：它处于约 36–42 个交易日周期的哪个位置，以及其前十大持仓中有多少处于买入构筑（筑底中或买入区）。各状态的历史基础概率见下钻页面。") }}</th>
      </tr>
      {% for r in sector_rows %}
      <tr>
        <td class="l"><a href="sectors/{{ r.ticker }}.html"><b>{{ r.ticker }}</b></a> <span class="muted">{{ td(r.name) }}</span></td>
        <td class="l" data-sort="{{ r.heat }}">
          <span class="help" style="width:auto;height:auto;border:none;margin:0;border-radius:6px">
            <span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;cursor:help">
              <span style="display:inline-block;width:64px;height:9px;background:var(--panel2);border-radius:5px;overflow:hidden"><i style="display:block;height:100%;width:{{ r.heat }}%;background:{{ r.heat_color }}"></i></span>
              <b>{{ r.heat }}</b>
              <span class="muted" style="font-size:11px">{{ td(r.heat_label) }}</span>
            </span>
            <span class="tip">{{ r.heat_tip }}</span>
          </span>
        </td>
        <td><span class="pill stg-{{ r.stage }}">{{ td(r.stage) }}</span></td>
        <td class="{{ 'pos' if r.mom_60d_pct > 0 else 'neg' }}" data-sort="{{ r.mom_60d_pct }}">{{ "%+.1f" | format(r.mom_60d_pct) }}%</td>
        <td class="{{ 'pos' if r.tech_ok else '' }}" style="font-size:12px">{{ r.tech_str }}</td>
        <td>
          <span class="help" style="width:auto;height:auto;border:none;margin:0">
            <span style="cursor:help">{{ r.season_str }}</span>
            <span class="tip tip-seas">{{ r.season_tip }}</span>
          </span>
        </td>
        <td>{{ r.trigger_str }}</td>
        <td>
          {% if r.timing_state %}
            <span class="pill st-{{ r.timing_state | replace(' ', '_') }}">{{ td(r.timing_label) }}</span>
            <div class="muted" style="font-size:11px">{{ r.timing_note }}</div>
          {% else %}—{% endif %}
        </td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </table>
    <p class="muted" style="font-size:12px">{{ t('Click any sector for its full drill-down: cycle position, multi-timeframe momentum, and each top-10 holding analyzed individually.', '点击任意板块查看完整下钻：周期位置、多时间尺度动量，以及逐一分析的每个前十大持仓。') }}</p>
  </div>
  {% endif %}{# /mode != macro — size/style + sector heat #}

  {% if mode != 'stocks' %}
  <div class="panel span6">
    <h2>{{ t('Commodities & macro tape', '大宗商品与宏观盘面') }}
      {{ help("The non-equity instruments the regime engine watches, with their technicals and seasonal tendency. No heat score here — regime alignment and rotation stages are equity-sector concepts.", "周期引擎所关注的非股票类标的，及其技术面与季节性倾向。这里没有热度分数 — 周期契合度与轮动阶段是股票板块的概念。") }}
    </h2>
    <table>
      <tr><th class="l">{{ t('instrument', '标的') }}</th><th>{{ t('trend', '趋势') }}</th><th>RSI</th><th>{{ t('off 52w high', '距52周高') }}</th><th>{{ t('3mo', '3月') }}</th><th>{{ t('seasonal', '季节性') }}</th></tr>
      {% for c in commodities %}
      <tr>
        <td class="l"><b>{{ td(c.name) }}</b></td>
        <td>{{ "✓" if c.above200 else "✗" }}200d {{ "✓" if c.above50 else "✗" }}50d</td>
        <td>{{ c.rsi14 | round | int if c.rsi14 is not none else "—" }}</td>
        <td class="{{ 'neg' if c.off_52w_high_pct < -10 else '' }}">{{ "%+.1f" | format(c.off_52w_high_pct) }}%</td>
        <td class="{{ 'pos' if c.mom_60d_pct > 0 else 'neg' }}">{{ "%+.1f" | format(c.mom_60d_pct) }}%</td>
        <td>
          <span class="help" style="width:auto;height:auto;border:none;margin:0">
            <span style="cursor:help">{{ (c.season_this or "—").split(":")[1].split("avg")[0].strip() if c.season_this else "—" }}</span>
            <span class="tip">{{ t(c.season_this, c.season_this_zh) if c.season_this else t("Not enough history.", "历史数据不足。") }}</span>
          </span>
        </td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="panel span6" id="liquidity">
    <h2>{{ t('Fed liquidity — the money tide', '美联储流动性 — 资金潮') }}
      {{ help("Top: net money in the system (Fed balance sheet minus reverse-repo minus the Treasury's account), in billions. Bottom: its 4-week change — the impulse. Green above the dotted line = expanding (historically the most reliable tailwind); red below = contracting.", "上方：系统内的净资金（美联储资产负债表减逆回购减财政部账户），单位十亿。下方：其 4 周变化 — 即动能。虚线之上为绿色 = 扩张（历史上最可靠的顺风）；下方为红色 = 收缩。") }}
    </h2>
    <div class="chart">{{ chart_liquidity | safe }}</div>
  </div>

  <div class="panel span6" id="credit">
    <h2>{{ t('Credit stress & market breadth', '信用压力与市场广度') }}
      {{ help("Top: the extra yield junk-bond investors demand — the market's best early smoke detector; rising = stress building; below ~4% is calm. Bottom: % of S&P 500 stocks above their 50-day average — participation. Strong indexes with collapsing breadth are fragile.", "上方：垃圾债投资者要求的额外收益率 — 市场最好的早期烟雾探测器；上行 = 压力累积；低于约 4% 为平静。下方：标普 500 中高于其 50 日均线的股票占比 — 即参与度。指数走强而广度崩塌则脆弱。") }}
    </h2>
    <div class="chart">{{ chart_credit_breadth | safe }}</div>
  </div>

  <!-- ======================= VIX MONITOR ======================= -->
  {% if vix %}
  <div class="panel span6" id="vix-monitor">
    <h2>{{ t('VIX monitor', 'VIX 监测') }}
      {{ help("The 30-day VIX path with the conventional regime bands (below 15 = calm/complacent, 20-25 = elevated, above 30 = high fear). The sharper read shown beside is OURS: the VIX term structure (spot vs 3-month — backwardation = near-term stress) and where today sits in VIX's own history.", "30 日 VIX 走势，叠加常规区间（低于 15 = 平静／自满，20–25 = 偏高，高于 30 = 高度恐慌）。旁边给出的是我们更锐利的解读：VIX 期限结构（现货对 3 个月 — 倒挂＝近期压力）以及今日在 VIX 自身历史中的位置。") }}
    </h2>
    <div class="vixhead">
      <span class="vixnum">{{ '%.2f' | format(vix.last) }}</span>
      <span class="{{ 'pos' if vix.chg > 0 else 'neg' if vix.chg < 0 else 'muted' }}">{{ '%+.2f' | format(vix.chg) }} ({{ '%+.1f' | format(vix.pct) }}%)</span>
      <span class="badge vix-{{ vix.tone }}">{{ vix.regime }}</span>
    </div>
    <p class="muted" style="font-size:13px; margin:8px 2px 4px; line-height:1.5">
      {% if vix.ratio is not none %}{{ t('Term structure', '期限结构') }} <b>{{ '%.2f' | format(vix.ratio) }}</b> {{ vix.rword }} · {% endif %}
      <span class="l-en">today sits at the <b>{{ '%.0f' | format(vix.pctile) }}th</b> percentile of VIX history</span><span class="l-zh">今日处于 VIX 历史 <b>{{ '%.0f' | format(vix.pctile) }}</b> 百分位</span>
    </p>
    <div class="chart">{{ chart_vix | safe }}</div>
    <div class="vixstats">
      <span class="kv">{{ vix.days }}{{ t('d high', '日高') }} <b>{{ '%.2f' | format(vix.hi) }}</b></span>
      <span class="kv">{{ vix.days }}{{ t('d low', '日低') }} <b>{{ '%.2f' | format(vix.lo) }}</b></span>
      <span class="kv">{{ t('prev close', '前收') }} <b>{{ '%.2f' | format(vix.prev) }}</b></span>
    </div>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ======================= POSITIONING ======================= -->
  <div class="panel span6" id="positioning">
    <h2>{{ t("Who's positioned how — the crowd meter", '谁如何持仓 — 拥挤度计') }}
      {{ help("What different investor groups are currently doing, shown as a position on each dial. The middle is normal; the ENDS are the danger zones — when a marker sits at either extreme, that trade is crowded and prone to violent reversal. Hover each name for the underlying numbers.", "不同投资者群体当前在做什么，以每个刻度盘上的位置呈现。中间为正常；两端是危险区 — 当标记落在任一极端时，该交易已拥挤且易发生剧烈反转。将鼠标悬停在每个名称上可查看底层数字。") }}
    </h2>
    <table>
      <tr><th class="l">{{ t('who / what', '谁／什么') }}</th><th class="l" style="min-width:150px">{{ t('where they stand', '当前位置') }}</th><th class="l">{{ t('what it means', '含义') }}</th></tr>
      {% for p in positioning %}
      <tr>
        <td class="l">{{ p.name }} {{ help(p.tip) }}</td>
        <td class="l">
          {% if p.pct is not none %}
            <div class="pgauge"><i style="left: {{ p.pct | round(1) }}%"></i></div>
            <div class="pends"><span>{{ p.left }}</span><span>{{ p.right }}</span></div>
          {% else %}
            <span class="plabel {{ 'plabel-hot' if 'amplif' in p.label or 'hedg' in p.label or 'complacent' in p.label else 'plabel-norm' }}">{{ p.label }}</span>
          {% endif %}
        </td>
        <td class="l muted">
          {% if p.pct is not none %}<b style="color:var(--text)">{{ p.label }}</b>{% if p.verdict %} — {{ p.verdict }}{% endif %}
          {% else %}{{ p.verdict }}{% endif %}
        </td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </table>
  </div>

  {% endif %}{# /mode != stocks — commodities, liquidity, credit, positioning #}

  {% if mode != 'macro' %}
  <!-- ======================= ACCUMULATION WATCH ======================= -->
  <div class="panel span12" id="accumulation">
    <h2>{{ t('🐳 Accumulation watch — sector ETFs', '🐳 增持监测 — 板块 ETF') }}
      {{ help("Each sector SPDR's top-10 weights, with each holding's weight change split into the part explained by the stock's own price move and a residual ('active' = weight that grew MORE than price alone). A large positive residual = real buying flowed into the name beyond market drift. HONEST CAVEAT: these SPDRs are PASSIVE index funds, so the residual is index reconstitution / float-weight flow (forced index-fund buying), NOT a discretionary manager's conviction — that reading comes with the active funds in the planned top-200 page. The technical column shows the stock's own cycle state; ✅ marks accumulation that also has a forming buy setup. Thresholds are uncalibrated until more snapshot history accumulates.", "每只板块 SPDR 的前十大权重；每只持仓的权重变动被拆分为“由个股自身价格变动解释的部分”与“残差”（“主动”=权重增长超过价格涨幅的部分）。较大的正残差=除市场漂移外确有真实买盘流入该股。诚实提示：这些 SPDR 是被动指数基金，故残差代表指数再平衡／流通权重调整带来的资金流（被动强制买入），并非主动经理的信念——后者要等到计划中的前 200 ETF 页面里的主动基金。技术面列显示个股自身的周期状态；✅ 表示增持同时出现了正在形成的买入形态。在积累更多快照历史前，阈值尚未校准。") }}
    </h2>
    {% if accumulation %}
      <table>
        <tr>
          <th class="l">{{ t('sector', '板块') }}</th>
          <th class="l">{{ t('stock', '个股') }}</th>
          <th>{{ t('raw Δwt', '原始权重Δ') }}</th>
          <th>{{ t('active Δwt', '主动权重Δ') }}</th>
          <th>{{ t('est. flow', '估算资金流') }}</th>
          <th class="l">{{ t('technical', '技术面') }}</th>
        </tr>
        {% for a in accumulation %}
        <tr>
          <td class="l muted">{{ a.fund }} · {{ td(a.sector) }}</td>
          <td class="l"><a href="stock.html#{{ a.ticker }}"><b>{{ a.ticker }}</b></a> <span class="muted">{{ a.name }}</span></td>
          <td class="{{ 'pos' if a.raw_change >= 0 else 'neg' }}">{{ "%+.2f" | format(a.raw_change) }}pp</td>
          <td class="{{ 'pos' if a.active_change >= 0 else 'neg' }}"><b>{{ "%+.2f" | format(a.active_change) }}pp</b></td>
          <td class="muted">{{ a.flow_str }}</td>
          <td class="l">
            {% if a.ladder %}<span class="pill st-{{ a.ladder.state | replace(' ', '_') }}">{{ td(a.ladder.label) }}</span>{% if a.confirmed %} ✅{% endif %}{% else %}<span class="muted">—</span>{% endif %}{% if a.vol and a.vol.surging %} <span title="volume {{ a.vol.ratio }}× its recent average">📊</span>{% endif %}
          </td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </table>
      <p class="muted" style="font-size:12px;margin-top:8px">{{ t('“Active Δwt” strips out price: it is the percentage points of weight a name gained beyond what its own price move explains. On passive index ETFs this captures index reconstitution / float-weight flow, not a manager’s discretion. The estimated $ flow applies the active Δwt to the fund’s AUM and is approximate.', '“主动权重Δ”已剔除价格因素：它是个股权重增长中超出其自身价格涨幅所能解释的百分点。在被动指数 ETF 上，这反映的是指数再平衡／流通权重调整带来的资金流，而非经理人的主动决策。估算的美元资金流是将“主动权重Δ”乘以基金 AUM 得出的近似值。') }}</p>
    {% else %}
      <p class="muted">{{ t('Building — needs at least two daily holdings snapshots per fund (collection began 2026-06-11). Decomposed accumulation signals appear once a second snapshot lands.', '构建中 — 每只基金至少需要两个每日持仓快照（采集自 2026-06-11 开始）。第二个快照落地后将显示拆解后的增持信号。') }}</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  <!-- ======================= HOLDINGS / FLOWS ======================= -->
  <div class="panel span12" id="holdings">
    <h2>{{ t("Real fund moves — strongest conviction", '基金真实动作 — 信念最强') }}
      {{ help("The top conviction-ranked ACCUMULATION decisions across curated thematic/industry funds (SPDR sector, Global X) and actively managed funds (ARK), with mechanical flow AND price moves stripped out. Conviction = percentage POINTS of fund weight the manager actually committed — so a real add to a meaningful position outranks a tiny position doubling. The full board (incl. trims & every fund) is the 🐳 Real fund moves page.", "在精选的主题／行业基金（SPDR 板块、Global X）与主动管理基金（ARK）中，按信念排序的最强增持决策，已剔除机械性资金流与价格变动。信念 = 经理人实际投入的基金权重百分点——因此对有意义仓位的真实增持会胜过微小仓位的翻倍。完整看板（含减持与全部基金）见 🐳 基金真实动作 页面。") }}
      <a href="etfs.html" class="muted" style="font-size:12px;font-weight:400;float:right">{{ t('see all →', '查看全部 →') }}</a>
    </h2>
    {% if holdings_changes %}
      <table>
        <tr><th class="l">{{ t('fund', '基金') }}</th><th class="l">{{ t('stock', '个股') }}</th><th class="l">{{ t('sector', '板块') }}</th><th class="r">{{ t('weight', '权重') }}</th><th class="r">{{ t('conviction Δwt', '信念权重Δ') }}</th><th class="l">{{ t('technical', '技术面') }}</th></tr>
        {% for h in holdings_changes %}
        <tr><td class="l"><b>{{ h.fund }}</b></td>
            <td class="l"><a href="stock.html#{{ h.ticker }}"><b>{{ h.ticker }}</b></a> <span class="muted">{{ h.name }}</span></td>
            <td class="l muted">{{ td(h.sector) if h.sector else "—" }}</td>
            <td class="r muted">{% if h.get('weight_pct') is not none %}{{ "%.2f" | format(h.weight_pct) }}%{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>
            <td class="r {{ ('pos' if h.conviction_pp >= 0 else 'neg') if h.get('conviction_pp') is not none else 'muted' }}"><b>{% if h.get('conviction_pp') is not none %}{{ "%+.2f" | format(h.conviction_pp) }}pp{% else %}—{% endif %}</b></td>
            <td class="l">{% if h.ladder %}<span class="pill st-{{ h.ladder.state | replace(' ', '_') }}">{{ td(h.ladder.label) }}</span>{% if h.confirmed %} ✅{% endif %}{% else %}<span class="muted">—</span>{% endif %}</td></tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </table>
    {% else %}
      <p class="muted">{{ t('No significant manager moves in the current window (needs a few trading days of snapshots).', '当前窗口内无显著的经理人动作（需要数个交易日的快照）。') }}</p>
    {% endif %}

    <h2 style="margin-top:16px">{{ t('Where ETF money is flowing', 'ETF 资金流向何处') }}
      {{ help("Daily money in/out of each sector's main ETF, from share creations/redemptions (ΔShares × price). Positive = money entering. History builds from June 2026.", "每个板块主力 ETF 的每日资金进出，来自份额的申购／赎回（份额变动 × 价格）。正值 = 资金进入。历史自 2026 年 6 月起累积。") }}
    </h2>
    {% if flows_html %}
      {{ flows_html | safe }}
    {% else %}
      <p class="muted">{{ t('Collecting — needs at least two daily snapshots per fund.', '采集中 — 每只基金至少需要两个每日快照。') }}</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  {% endif %}{# /mode != macro — accumulation + holdings/flows #}

  {% if mode != 'stocks' %}
  <!-- ======================= HEALTH ======================= -->
  <div class="panel span12" id="health">
    <h2>{{ t('Data health', '数据健康度') }}
      {{ help("Every data source this dashboard depends on. OK = fresh. STALE = no new data lately (signal confidence reduced automatically). FAILED = today's fetch broke (yesterday's data still used). BLOCKED = a known, documented limitation — not a malfunction. DEAD = failed 3+ runs and paused until it recovers.", "本仪表盘所依赖的每个数据源。OK = 新鲜。STALE = 近期无新数据（信号置信度已自动下调）。FAILED = 今日抓取失败（仍沿用昨日数据）。BLOCKED = 已知且有记录的限制 — 并非故障。DEAD = 连续 3 次以上失败，已暂停直至恢复。") }}
    </h2>
    <table>
      <tr><th class="l">{{ t('source', '数据源') }}</th><th class="l">{{ t('status', '状态') }}</th><th>{{ t('rows', '行数') }}</th><th>{{ t('last data', '最新数据') }}</th><th class="l">{{ t('note', '备注') }}</th></tr>
      {% for s in health %}
      <tr>
        <td class="l">{{ s.name }}</td>
        <td class="l"><span class="pill pill-{{ s.status }}">{{ s.status }}</span></td>
        <td>{{ s.rows }}</td><td>{{ s.last_date or "—" }}</td>
        <td class="l muted">{{ s.error or "" }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </table>
    <p class="muted"><span class="l-en">A failed source never crashes the dashboard — affected signals just lose confidence until it heals.
       Generated {{ generated_utc }} UTC · <a href="aibrief.html">AI daily brief</a> ·
       <a href="history.html">history & charts</a> · <a href="validation_timeline.html">full 2007→ backtest</a></span><span class="l-zh">数据源失败绝不会让仪表盘崩溃 — 受影响的信号只是降低置信度，直到其恢复。
       生成于 {{ generated_utc }} UTC · <a href="aibrief.html">AI每日简报</a> ·
       <a href="history.html">历史与图表</a> · <a href="validation_timeline.html">完整 2007→ 回测</a></span></p>
  </div>
  {% endif %}{# /mode != stocks — data health #}

</div>
<script>
  // keep tooltips on-screen: open downward near the top, and anchor to the
  // nearest side when close to the left/right viewport edges
  document.addEventListener('mouseover', function (e) {
    var h = e.target.closest('.help, .hovchart');
    if (!h) return;
    var r = h.getBoundingClientRect();
    h.classList.toggle('below', r.top < 330);
    var tip = h.querySelector('.tip');
    var half = ((tip && tip.offsetWidth) || 290) / 2 + 16;
    h.classList.remove('edge-right', 'edge-left');
    if (r.left + r.width / 2 + half > window.innerWidth) h.classList.add('edge-right');
    else if (r.left + r.width / 2 - half < 0) h.classList.add('edge-left');
  });
</script>
<script>
  // Deep-link highlight: when an alert links to a scorecard (#liquidity, #credit,
  // …), smooth-scroll to that panel and pulse a glow so it's obvious which card
  // the alert came from — whether arriving from the landing hub (page load with
  // a #hash) or clicking an alert on this page.
  (function () {
    function flash(id) {
      var el = document.getElementById(id);
      if (!el) return;
      el.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });
      el.classList.remove('flash');
      void el.offsetWidth;            // restart the animation on a re-click
      el.classList.add('flash');
      setTimeout(function () { el.classList.remove('flash'); }, 2600);
    }
    function fromHash() {
      var id = (location.hash || '').replace('#', '');
      if (id && document.getElementById(id)) setTimeout(function () { flash(id); }, 60);
    }
    window.addEventListener('load', fromHash);
    window.addEventListener('hashchange', fromHash);
    document.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
      var a = e.target.closest('a.alert[href^="#"]');
      if (!a) return;
      var id = a.getAttribute('href').slice(1);
      // re-clicking when the hash is already set won't fire hashchange — flash now
      if (location.hash === '#' + id) { e.preventDefault(); flash(id); }
    });
  })();
</script>
<script>
/* Chinese-mode chart recolour + relabel map (baked chart colours are constants).
   Colour pairs are symmetric so the same map flips both ways; charts always
   render on dark slate so only these green/red + quad green/red hexes swap. */
window.__CHART_SWAP__ = {
  colors: {"#5fbf7f":"#e07070","#e07070":"#5fbf7f","#2e9e4f":"#d04545","#d04545":"#2e9e4f"},
  labels: {"growth":"增长","inflation":"通胀","net liquidity":"净流动性","4w RoC":"4周变化",
           "HY OAS %":"高收益债利差 %","% S&P500 > 50DMA":"标普500 高于50日均线 %"}
};
</script>
